<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Biblica® Open Kiyombe Contemporary New Testament and Psalms 2002</book>
  <para style="h">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsamu Wumboti wusonika Malako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malako</para>
  <para style="toc3">Malako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsamu Wumboti wusonika</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malako</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">KHUBUKULU YI KISALU KI YESU</para>
  <para style="s1">Yowani Mbotiki mvuala Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayi 3.1-12</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-6">Luka 3.1-6</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yowani 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Thonono Nsamu wu mboti wu Yesu Klisto, Muana Nzambi, <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>banga busonimina mu nkanda mbikudi Ezayi :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="qt">Tala ! Ndiela fidisa mvualꞌama ku ntualꞌaku,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">
    <char style="qt">niandi wela kubika nzilꞌaku.</char><verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>
    <char style="qt">Yawu mbembo yi mutu wunyamikina mu dikanga :</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="qt">Lukubika nzila yi Pfumu,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">
    <char style="qt">Luludika minsolo miandi.</char><verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Yowani wuyiza, wuba botikanga mu dikanga ayi wuba tubanga ti : “Bika lubotama mu diambu di monisa ti lubaludi mavanga ; buna Nzambi wela kululemvukila mu masumu meno.”<verse eid="MRK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Batu boso baba mu zunga ki Yuda ayi batubobo baba kalanga ku Yelusalemibaba kuendanga kuidi niandi. Wuba botikanga mu nlangu Yolidani bu baba tambudilanga masumu mawu. <verse eid="MRK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Yowani wuba vuatanga minledi mivangulu mu mika mi kamela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kamela</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phila bulu kidi banga phunda ; kidi ayi khuki kikubuku mu natangabizitu mu dikanga. Kizebi nua nlangu wuwombo-wombo. Tala diaka Matayi 3.4.</char></note>. Bosi nsinga kaba nkanganga mu luketo wuvangulu mu nkanda wu bulu. Bidiakaba ndianga : makhoko ayi niosi. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Malongi kaba longanga mawu mama :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:7">—Fioti fisiedi malumona mutu wumosi wunkuiza ku manima mama, niandi wudutidi mu lulendo ; ndisi fuana nkutu ko mu yinama mu diambu di nianguna minsinga mi zisapatu ziandi. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Minu mu nlangu ndilembo kulubotikila vayi niandi mu pheve Yinlongokela kulubotikila.<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubotama ayi wutotu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayi 3.13-17</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Mu thangu yina Yesu wuba ku Nazaleti, buala buidi mu Ngalili, wuyiza kuidi Yowani ayi niandi wumbotika mu nlangu Yolidani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Mu thangu kaba totuka mu nlangu, kazimbukulu Diyilu dizibukidi, Pheve Yinlongo yikuluka va niandi banga dibembi. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Mbembo yitotuka ku Diyilu, yiwakana :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:11">—Ngeyo widi mwanꞌama wu luzolo ; khini yiwombo wukumbonisanga.<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayi 4.1-11</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Vana vawu Pheve yituma Yesu mu kuenda ku dikanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>Makumaya ma bilumbu kavuandila kuna ayi kuna Satana kantotila. Wuba mvuandanga ayi bibulu bi nsitu bosi zimbasi ziba kunsadilanga.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">KISALU KI YESU KU NGALILI</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutona longa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayi 4.12-17</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Bu bakanga Yowani, Yesu wuyiza ku Ngalili mu longa Nsamu wumboti wu Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Wuba tubanga ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:15">—Thangu yifueni ! Kipfumu ki Nzambi kifikimini. Bika lubalula mavanga ayi luwilukila Nsamu wumboti.<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minlonguki mitheti ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayi 4.18-22</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-5">Luka 5.1-5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:10-11">10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Lumbu kimosi Yesu bu kaba kuenda yendanga mu mbembele mbu wu Ngalili, wumona Simoni ayi khombꞌandi Andele banloza dikondi mu mbu, bila baba banlobi mbizi.<verse eid="MRK 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:17">—Ndandakananu ayi ndiela kulukitula minlobi mi batu.<verse eid="MRK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Muna thangu beni, basia bika makondi mawu ayi banlandakana. <verse eid="MRK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Buela kuesa fioti ; wumona zaki muana Zebede ayi khombꞌandi Yowani ; balembo londi makondi mu khati nlungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Vana vawu wuba tela. Basia bika dise diawu Zebede ayi bisadi biandi muna nlungu ; banlandakana.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukuka ziphevi zimbimbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Bayenda ku Kafalinawumi. Lumbu ki saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lumbu ki saba</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tala Matayi 12.1</char></note> bu kifuana, Yesu wukota mu nzo lukutukunu ayi wutona longa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Basimina mu diambu di malongi mandi. Bila wuba longila mu lulendo vayi bika banga minlongi mi mina. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Muna nzo lukutukunu muba mutu wumosi wuba pheve yimbimbi, wutona yamikina :<verse eid="MRK 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>—A ! Yesu muisi Nazaleti, mbi mambu tuidi beto yaku e ? Wizidi mu kutubunga e ? Minu ndizebi, ngeyo widi nani : widi mutu wunlongo wu Nzambi.<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesu wutemina pheve yimbimbi ayi wuntumina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:25">—Bika biyoko, totuka mu mutu wawu !<verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Pheve yimbimbi yitukumuna mutu beni, yiyamikina mu mbembo yingolobosi yitotuka.<verse eid="MRK 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Babo basimina ayi baba kukiyuvula bawu na bawu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:27">—A ! Diambu mbi diadi e ? Talanu ndongolo yimona yinlongolo mu lulendo. Niandi wuntumina ziphevi zimbimbi ayi ziphevi beni zikuntumukina.<verse eid="MRK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Buna tsanguꞌandi yitembakana mu zunga kioso ki Ngalili.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa bambevo bawombo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-15">Matayi 8.14-15</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-39">Luka 4.38-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Muna thangu yina kaka, buna batumbu totuka mu nzo lukutukunu. Yesu, Zaki ayi Yowani bayenda ku nzo Simoni ayi Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Nzitu wu Simoni wu nketo wuba wuleka va mbuka bila zinzangala ziba yandi. Yesu buna katumbu kota ; bankamba tsangu mu diambu diandi. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Bu kafikama, wunsimba mu koko, wuntelimisa. Zinzangala zimana, bosi weka kuba sadila.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:24">Matayi 4.24</ref> ; <ref loc="MAT 8:16-17">8.16-17</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 4:40-41">Luka 4.40-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Mu masika, thangu bu yidiama, bannatina bambevo zioso ayi batu bobo baba ziphevi zimbimbi. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Batu boso ba divula bakutakana va muelo nzo. Simoni ayi Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Wubelusa batu bawombo baba bimbevo bi phila mu phila ayi wukukaziphevi ziwombo zimbimbi ayi wuzikandika zibika yoluka bila zizaba Yesu niandi nani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Mu nsuka buna kukidi tombo fioti, Yesu wukotuka ayi wutotuka ku nganda, wuyenda ku buangu kisuama mu diambu di sambila.<verse eid="MRK 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simoni ayi batu bobo baba yandi bantomba. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Buna bambakula, bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:37">—Batu boso ngeyo bantomba !<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Vayi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:38">—Tuendanu kueto ku buangu kinkaka, mu mala momo mafikimini. Mfueti longa mu mala beni, bila diawu ndiyizila !<verse eid="MRK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Buna wulonga mu zinzo ziawu zi zikhutukunu mu Ngalili dioso ayi wukuka ziphevi zimbimbi.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Mutu wumosi wuba buazi wuyiza fukimina Yesu ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:40">—Enati tidi, beki kuaku bu kumbelusa.<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Yesu wummona kiadi, wunonuna koko, wunsimba ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 1:41">—Nyinga thidi, beluka kuaku !<verse eid="MRK 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Vana vawu buazi bubotukidi, mu mutu beni, wutumbu beluka.<verse eid="MRK 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Yesu wumvutula ku nzo andi bu kanlubula ti :<verse eid="MRK 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>—Keba, kadi kamba kadi mutu wumosi mambu mama vayi yenda kimonisa kuidi nganga Nzambi ayi yenda tambika makaba momo Moyize kavanina lutumunumu diambu di kiba kimbangi kuidi bawu ti ngeyo belukidi.<verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Vayi buna katumbu totuka ; wutona yamikisa kuidi batu bosomambu moso mavangama mu niandi ayi wutembikisa tsangu beni mumo. Mu bila kioki yesu kakadila mu bibuangu bisuama. Vayi batu baba mu zindambu zioso baba kuizanga kuidi niandi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutelimisa dikoka ayi wulemvukila masumu mandi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayi 9.1-8</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Ndambu bilumbu bu bivioka, Yesu wubuela kuenda ku Kafalinawumi. Bawa tsangu ti widi kuna nzo. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Nkangu wu batu wukutakana muna. Batu bawokila ngolo, diawu nkutu bibuangu bisia buela monika ko ka diambu ko va muelo. Vayi Yesu wuba longa mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Batu baya bayiza kuidi niandi, ayi, banata dikoka. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Vayi bu basia nunga ko mu kuntudisa vaba Yesu bila nkangu wu batu wuwokila ngolo ; diawu batobudila divudu mu muanzu vana vawu vabela Yesu. Bosi bakulula kiphoyi bila wuba wuleka va kiphoyi beni.<verse eid="MRK 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yesu bu kamona minu kiawu ; buna wukamba kuidi dikoka ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:5">—A muanꞌama, masumu maku malemvokolo !<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Minlongi minkaka mi Mina miba vana mitona niunguta mu mintima miawu :<verse eid="MRK 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>—A bila mbi mutu wawu kanyolukila bobo e ? Keti lembo vuezi Nzambi ! Nani wunlemvukilanga masumu e ? A keti Nzambi kaka wunlemvukilanga masumu !<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Vana vawu Yesu, mu pheve andi, bu kazaba mayindu mawu, wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:8">—Bila mbi lunyindudila mayindu ma phila yoyi e ? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Diambu mbi diodi dikambulu phasi mu kamba kuidi dikoka : “Masumu makumalemvokolo” voti “Telama, nanguna kiphoyi kiaku ayi diata”. <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Vayi muingi luzaba ti Muana Mutu beki lulendo lu lemvukila masumu va ntoto…<verse eid="MRK 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>Buna wukamba dikoka ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:11">—Ndikutumina : Telama, bonga kiphoyi kiaku, vutuka ku nzoꞌaku !<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Vana vawu mutu beni wutelama, wubonga kiphoyi kiandi, wutotuka va meso ma batu boso. Baboso basimina ayi bakembisa Nzambi bu batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:12">—Tumueni ko mambu ma phila yayi !<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafindisa Yesu ziphaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayi 9.9-13</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesu wuyenda diaka ayi wudiata mu mbembele mbu, nkangu wu batu wuyiza ku kaba ayi wuba longa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Bu kaba vioka, wumona Levi, muana Alafayi, vuendi mu bilu kiba mfutisilanga ziphaku ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:14">—Wundandakana. Niandi wutelama ayi wunlandakana.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Yesu bu kaba dia ku nzo Levi ; mimfutisi mi ziphaku miwombo ayi bankua masumu bawombo badia yandi va kimosi ayi minlonguki miandi ; bila batu bawombo banlandakana.<verse eid="MRK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Minlongi mi mina mi Bafalisi bu mimona ti Yesu wulembo dia va kimosi ayi mimfutisi mi zipaku ayi bankua masumu, mieka nyuvula minlonguki mi Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:16">—Bila mbi Nlongi eno kalembo dila va kimosi ayi mimfutisi mi ziphaku ayi bankua masumu e ?<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Yesu bu kawa bobo, buna wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:17">—Batu badi buvini basi mfunu wu munganga ko, vayi badi kimbevo bawu bantombanga munganga ! Ndisia kuiza ko mu tela basonga vayi ndiyiza mu tela bankua masumu.<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayi 9.14-17</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Minlonguki mi Yowani ayi Bafalisi baba kukifuisanga nzala mudiambu di lusambulu. Buna bayiza yuvula Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:18">—Bila mbi minlonguki mi Yowani ayi mi Bafalisi beti kukifuisila nzala mu diambu di lusambulu vayi minlonguki miaku mikifuisanga nzala ko mu diambu di lusambulu e ?<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:19">—Buevi ; batu batumusu ku nyengo makuela balenda kukifuisa nzala mu diambu di lusambulu bu bakidi va kimosi ayi mutu wowo kuedidi e ? Mutu wowo sadisidi nyengo bu kadi yawu va kimosi, balendi kifuisa nzala mu diambu di lusambulu ko. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Vayi vela ba lumbu, bu bela ku babotula mutu wowo kuedidi bunabosi bela kifuisa nzala mu diambu di lusambulu.<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>Mutu kalendi bonga tendi kimona ko muingi kalondila nledi wukhulu. Niandi vanga bobo buna kimona kieka buela kakuna nledi wukhulu ayi buna divudu diela ba dinneni. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Bobuawu mutu kalendi tula ko vinu kimona mu zitsaku zikhulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zitsaku zikhulu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bana ba Iseli baba kifu ki lundilanga vinu mu zitsaku zivangulu mu minkanda mi bibulu vayi mu nkanda wu khombo baba luta vangilanga ziawu.</char></note> bila vinu kimona kibeki bu kanzunina zitsaku zioso. Buna vinu kibungani ayi zitsaku zifuidi. Vayi beti lundila vinu kimona mu zitsaku zimona.<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu niandi Pfumu lumbu ki saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayi 12.1-8</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Bu kaba viokila mu tsola yi ble mu lumbu ki saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lumbu ki saba</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tala Matayi 12.1</char></note> ; minlonguki miandi bu miba vioka, mivela ble<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ble</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tala Matayi 3.12 ; 12.1 ; Luka 3.17.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Buna Bafalisi bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:24">—Tala ! Bila mbi minlonguki miaku mimvangila mambu momo makanduku mu lumbu ki saba e ?<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Niandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:25">—Lutengi ko mambu Davidi kavanga mu thangu niandi ayi bakundi bandi baba nzala ayi bakambu bidia e ? <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>Wukota muna Nzo Nzambi, niandi ayi bakundi bandi badia maphamomo matambuku kuidi Nzambi. Mu thangu beni Abiatali niandi wuba pfumu yi zinganga. Muaki zinganga ziawu kaka ziba minsua mu dia mapha beni ; vayi Davidi wudia mawu ayi wuvana batu bandi.<verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Yesu wubuela bakamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:27">—Lumbu ki saba kivangu mu diambu di mutu, bika sia ti mutu niandiwuvangu mu diambu di lumbu ki saba. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Diawu Muana Mutu niandi Pfumu lumbu ki saba.<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayi 12.9-14</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Yesu wubuela kota diaka mu nzo lukutukunu, kuna kuba mutu wumosi wuba koko kusioka. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Yesu baba tala keni lenda kumbelusa mu lumbu ki saba muingi babaka bu kumfundila.<verse eid="MRK 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yesu wukamba mutu wowo wuba koko kusioka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:3">—Telama vana, va ntuala batu boso.<verse eid="MRK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Bosi wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">—Minsua midi mu vanga mamboti voti mambimbi mu lumbu ki saba e ? Minsuamidi mu vukisa luzingu lu mutu voti mu vonda e ?<verse eid="MRK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Vayi kadi mutu kasia vutula kadi diambu ko. Yesu wuba tala mu nganzi ayi weka mona kiadi mu diambu di mintima miawu miba banga matadi. Bosi wukamba kuidi mutu wuba koko kusioka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:5">—Nonuna koko kuaku ! Wunonuna kuawu ayi koko kuandi kufuana. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Vana vawu, Bafalisi batumbu totuka mu nzo lukutukunu, bayenda kaza ayibatu ba dingumba di Elode muingi batomba diluaku di vondila Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu va khatitsika nkangu wu batu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesu ayi minlonguki miandi babotuka vana, bayenda ku ndambu mbu. Vayi nkangu wuwombo wu batu wuba landakana : baba ku Ngalili, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>ku Yuda, ku Yelusalemi, ku tsi Idume, ku disimu dinkaka di Yolidani. Batu bobo bazungidila bizunga bi Tile ayi Sidoni bayiza bawombo kuidi niandi bu bawa mambu momo kavanga. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Wukamba minlonguki miandi minkubikila nlungu muingi nkangu wu batu wubika kumfietikisa. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Muaki sumbu kabelusa batu bawombo, diawu bobo baba minsongo balundumuka kuiza kuidi niandi muingi bansimba.<verse eid="MRK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Bosi thangu batu baba ziphevi zimbimbi bammona, babua va ntualꞌandiayi bayamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:11">—Ngeyo widi Muana Nzambi !<verse eid="MRK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Vayi wuba kandika babika zabikisa ti niandi nani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusobula bamvuala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayi 10.1-4</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Yesu wukuma va mbata mongo ; wutela batu bobo kazola ayi batu beni bayiza kuidi niandi. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Kumi batu buadi kasobula bobo kabieka bamvuala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bobo kabieka bamvuala</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mambu mama masi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note> muingi babanga yandi va kimosi ; <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>ayi muingi kaba fidisa mu kuenda longi ayi mu diambu baba lulendo lu totudila ziphevi zimbimbi. <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Tala mazina makumi batu buadi bobo kasobula : <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>—Simoni mutu kabieka Piela ; Zaki, muana Zebede ayi khombꞌandi Yowani. Wuba vana dizina di Bowanelingesi bu dinsundula “bana ba nzazi” <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andele, Filipi, Balitelemi, Matayi, Toma, Zaki muana Alafayi, Tade, Simoni wuba mu dingumba di Bazeloti <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>ayi Yuda Isikalioti, mutu wuvakusa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi voti Satana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayi 12.22-32</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 11:15-23">Luka 11.15-23</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Bu kakota mu nzo, nkangu wu batu wuyiza kutakana diaka muna. Yesu ayi minlonguki miandi basia buela baka ko bu dila. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Bibutu biandi bu biwa nsamu beni, biyiza kunlanda mu kingolo bila baba tuba : “Weka dilawu”. <verse eid="MRK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Minlongi mi mina miba ku Yelusalemi mituba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:22">—Ku tsi minsua mi Belezebuli kadi. Mu lulendo lu pfumu yi ziphevi zimbimbi kalembo kukila ziphevi zimbimbi. <verse eid="MRK 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Buna Yesu wuba tumisa ayi wuba sudikisila mu zinongo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:23">—Buevi Satana kalenda kukila Satana e ? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Enati kipfumu kivasukidi kiawu veka, buna kipfumu beni kilendi zingila ko. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Enati nzo yivasukidi yawu veka, buna nzo beni yilendi zingila ko. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Enati Satana weka kinuanisa niandi veka, ayi enati widi wuvasuka, buna, kalendi zingila ko. Tsukulu andi yimonikini. <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>Kuisi ko mutu beki bukotila mu nzo yi mutu widi ngolo ayi yiba bima biandi enati kasi tuama kanga ko mutu beni. Buna bosi kalenda baka bu yibila bima bioso bidi mu nzo andi.<verse eid="MRK 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti masumu moso ayi bifingu biosobilenda fingu Nzambi biela lemvukulu <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>vayi woso kuandi wela finga Pheve yinlongo, kalendi lemvukulu ko ; wela natanga nkanu wu masumu momo mu zithangu zioso.<verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yesu wubayolukila buawu mu diambu di batu baba tubanga ti : “ku tsi minsua mu pheve yimbimbi kadi”.<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dikanda dikiedika di Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayi 12.46-50</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Ngudi yi Yesu ayi bakhomba bandi bayiza. Batelama ku nganda ayi batuma mutu mu kuntela.<verse eid="MRK 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Batu bawombo bavuanda ayi banzungidila Yesu. Buna bayiza ku nkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:32">—Tala ngudi aku ayi bakhomba ziaku badi ku nganda ayi ngeyo bantomba.<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:33">—A nani ngudi ama ayi banani bakhomba ziama e ?<verse eid="MRK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Bu tala batu bobo bantula va lukongolo, buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:34">—Tala ngudi ama ayi bakhomba ziama bawu baba. <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Woso mutu wumvanga luzolo lu Nzambi, niandi khombꞌama yi bakala ayi khombꞌama yi nketo ayi ngudi ama.<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi nkuni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-15">Matayi 13.1-15</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-10">Luka 8.4-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Yesu wubuela tona diaka longa va disimu di mbu. Nkangu wu batu wukutakana va kaba wuba wuwombo. Diawu kakumina mu nlungu, wuvuanda muna. Nkangu wu batu wuba va disimu va ndambu mbu. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Wuba longila mambu mawombo mu zinongo. Tala mambu kaba nlonga :<verse eid="MRK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>—Wanu mboti : Nkuni wumosi wuyenda ku kuna. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Bu kaba muanga mbongo, ndambu yibua mu yenda nzila ; zinuni ziyiza mana kuyidoda. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Ndambu yinkaka yibua va matadi ; vuma beni vasia ba ntoto wuwombo ko. Zitheti zivika mena kuandi bila ntoto wusia ba phiba ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Vayi muini wungolo bu wutotuka, mintuidila beni milebuka ayi miyuma bila misia ba mianzi ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Yinkaka yibua va zitsendi. Zitsendi beni zimena ayi zifietikisamintuidila beni. Diawu mintuidila beni misia buta mimbutu ko. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Vayi yinkaka yibua mu ntoto wumboti, yitotula mintuidila, mikula ayi mibuta mimbutu : yimosi makumatatu ; yinkaka makumasambanu, yinkaka khama. <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Buna wubuela bakamba : woso widi matu ma wila buna bika kawa.<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Bu kaba va niandi veka, batu bobo banzungidila va kimosi ayi kumi mimvuala miandi miodi banyuvula tsundu yi zinongo.<verse eid="MRK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:11">—Beno lutambula diluaku di zabila mansueki ma kipfumu ki Nzambi. Vayi kuidi batu bankaka bobo badi ku nganda, mamo mu zinongo kaka manyolokolo <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>muingi :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">Mu thangu bantala, batedi kuawu</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">vayi bakadi mona.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">Mu thangu banwa, bawilu kuawu</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">vayi bakadi sudika</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">muingi babika baluka kuidi Nzambi</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="qt">ayi masumu mawu mabika lemvokolo.</char><verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Bosi wubuela bakamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:13">—Lukadi sudika nongo yayi e ? Buna buevi lulenda sudikila zinongo zioso e ?<verse eid="MRK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayi 13.18-23</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>—Nkuni niandi wunkunanga mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Batu bankaka badi mbongo yidi muyenda nzila, mu kunu mambu ma Nzambi. Bu bawilu mawu, buna satana wunkuizanga nsualu mu ziona mambu ma Nzambi makunu mu bawu. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Bosi bankaka badi banga mbongo yikunu va ntoto widi matadi. Bawu wa mambu ma Nzambi, bantumbu vika kumatambulanga mu khini. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Vayi bu bakambulu mianzi, bazingilanga ko. Bila enati ziphasi voti zithotolo zitonini mu diambu di mambu ma Nzambi, buna beti vika bua. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Bankaka badi banga mbongo yikunu va zitsendi. Bawu beti wa mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>Vayi mambu beni makadi buta mimbutu mu diambu mayindu ma nza yayi, luvunu lu kimvuama ki nza ayi zitsatu zi mambu mankaka bu makotidi mu bawu buna mamfietikisanga Mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Bosi bankaka bawu bantambulanga mbongo mu ntoto wumboti. Bawu bobo beti wanga mambu ma Nzambi ayi bawu beti buta mimbutu miwombo : yinkaka makumatatu, yinkaka makumasambanu bosi yinkaka khama.<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi muinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Wuba kamba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:21">—A bwevi, beti nata muinda mu diambu di kuwutula ku tsi katini voti ku tsi mbuka e ? A keti beti kuwunata mu diambu di kuwutula va yilu meza. <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Mamo masuama mafueti ba va kiezila ayi mamo masueko mafueti totuka va nganda. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Enati mutu widi matu mawila buna bika kawa. <verse eid="MRK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Buna wubuela diaka : lulubuka mbote mu mamo momo lulembo wa bila bela kulutezila mu tezo kioki lusadila ayi bela buela mawombo. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Bila kuidi woso mutu beki, bela buela kumvana vayi kuidi mutu wowokambulu, bela kunziona biobi kutu bidi yandi.<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi mbongo yimena yawu veka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Wubuela tuba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:26">—Tala Kipfumu ki Nzambi kidedikini banga mutu wumosi wukuna mbongo mu ntoto. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Kaleka voti kakotuka va builu voti va muini, mbongo yimena ayi yiyonzuka yawu veka niandi mukambu zaba. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Ntoto wawu veka, wubuta mimbutu ; va thete wumenisa ntuidila, bosiwutotula tsangu bosi mimbutu miyela. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Thangu mimbutu mayedidi ; nkuni wubonga kikhondolo kimvedolongo mimbutu muingi kavedila mimbutu bila thangu yivedila yifuana.<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi luteti lu mutalide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayi 13.31-32</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Wubuela kamba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:30">—Mu mbi tulenda dedikisa kipfumu ki Nzambi ? Mu nongo mbi tulendakulukambila yawu e ? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Kipfumu ki Nzambi kidedikini banga luteti lu mutalide. Bu lukununumu ntoto, luawu lututidi keva mu zitheti zioso va nza. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Vayi luawu kunu mu ntoto lueti menanga ayi lumviokanga bikunusubioso mu kula ayi lueti totula matafi manneni ; kuna zinuni zilenda tungilazindiala ziawu ku tsi phozi andi.<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:34-35">Matayi 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Buna wuba longa mambu ma Nzambi mu zinongo ziwombo ziphilayayi, boso bubela diluaku di balenda kunsudikila. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Kalendi kuba yolukila ko mu kambu sadila nongo. Vayi ti weka va niandi veka ayi minlonguki miandi, buna wuba kuba sudikisanga mambu moso.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuviatuka vuka mu ngolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayi 8.23-27</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Va thangu masika muna lumbu kina, Yesu wukamba minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:35">—Tusabukanu ku disimu dinkaka. <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Basia bika nkangu wu batu ; bawu bannata mu nlungu boso bu kabela. Minlungu minkaka miba yandi vana. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Buela zimbukila vuka kingolo kieka. Mayo ma ngolo mabua mu nlungu. Bosi nlungu wutona wala nlangu. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Niandi wuba wuleka kuna tsongi nlungu. Wuniekika ntu andi va mbatakusa. Minlonguki minkotula ayi minkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:38">—A Nlongi ! Tueka mfua vayi Ngeyo wummona diawu diambu di phamba e ?<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Wukotuka, wutemina vuka ayi wuvana lutumu kuidi mbu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:39">—Bika biyoko ! Ba dio sui ! Vuka kimanisa ayi ndembama yivutuka.<verse eid="MRK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Bosi wuyuvula minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:40">—A bila mbi luididi boma-boma ? A buevi lukambulu minu e ? <verse eid="MRK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Beka mona boma buwombo ayi beka niunguta bawu veka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:41">—A buna nani mutu wawu muingi vuka ayi mbu bintumunika e ?<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuviatuka ziphevi zimbimbi mu ngolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayi 8.28-34</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Bu batula ku disimu dinkaka di mbu mu zunga ki basi Ngelasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngelasa</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekudi minkaka misonika “zunga ki basi Ngadala”, minkaka misonikazunga ki basi Ngelengesi. Tala Matayi 8.28 ; Luka 8.26.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Yesu bu katotuka mu nlungu ; mutu wumosi wuba ziphevi zimbimbi wutotuka mu mabumbi, wuyiza kundengana. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Mutu beni wuba vuandanga mu mabumbi ayi kadi mutu kalendikunkanga ko, ka diambu ko mu zisieni. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Bila zikhumbu ziwombo baba ku nkanganga bisengo ayi zisieni mu malu vayi wuba tabulanga zisieni beni ayi wuba bukunanga bisengo mu bitini. Ayi kadi mutu kasia ku nyodika ko. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Zithangu zioso, builu ayi muini, niandi wuba vuandanga mu biziamiayi ku miongo, wuba kuenda yamikinanga ayi ku kiluekanga mu matadi.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Bu kamona ti Yesu wukidi thama ; wuzawula ayi wuyiza fukama va ntualꞌandi, <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>ayi wuyamikina mu mbembo yi ngolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:7">—A yesu, Muana Nzambi yi zangama, mambu mbi tidi kuidi minu e ? Mu dizina di Nzambi ndikuleba : kadi kundiamisa.<verse eid="MRK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Bila wuba kambanga pheve yimbimbi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:8">—Pheve yi mbimbi totuka mu mutu wawu !<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Bosi Yesu wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">—A dizina diaku nani ! Niandi wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">—Dizina diama “Lengio” bu dinsundula tuidi bawombo.<verse eid="MRK 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Pheve yimbimbi yileba Yesu muingi kabika kuba kuka mu zunga ki tsi beni. <verse eid="MRK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Nkangu wu zingulu wunneni wuba dia kuna, kuna ndambu mongo.<verse eid="MRK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Zipheve zimbimbi zileba Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:12">—Wututuma tukota kueto mu zingulu ziazi !<verse eid="MRK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yesu wuba vana minsua. Buna ziphevi zimbimbi zitotuka mu mutu beni ayi ziyenda kota mu zingulu. Zingulu beni ziba tezo ki zimilizizole ; zinengumuka nsualu mu mongo ayi ziyenda bua mu mbu, ayi, zimana diama.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Minsungi mi zingulu beni mitina ayi minata tsangu mu mavula ayi mu ziphangu zi bibulu zitsola. Batu bayiza tala mambu momo mavioka. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Bu batula vaba Yesu, bamona mutu beni wowo wuba ziphevi zimbimbi, mutuwowo wuba lengio, buna kavuendi ; vueti minledi ayi diela diandi diosodiduka. Buna bamona boma. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Ayi baba kamba mambu mavioka kuidi batu bobo bamona boso mavangiminamu mutu wuba ziphevi zimbimbi ayi mu zingulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Buna batu beni baleba Yesu kabotuka mu zunga kiawu.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Mu thangu Yesu kaba nkota mu nlungu, mutu wowo wuba ziphevi zimbimbiwuyuvula Yesu enati lenda kunlandakana.<verse eid="MRK 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Vayi Yesu kasia kumvana ko minsua mu kunlandakana ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:19">—Vutuka ku nzoꞌaku, kuidi bakhomba ziaku ayi wuba kambi mambu Pfumu kavangidi ayi buevi kamuenini kiadi.<verse eid="MRK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Buna wuyenda ayi wutona samuna mu “kumi di mavula” mambu moso mamvangila Yesu. Baboso basimina buwombo.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuviatuka bimbevo ayi lufua mu ngolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayi 9.18-26</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesu bu kabuela sabuka, mu nlungu, ku disimu dinkaka di mbu ; nkangu wu batu bawombo bayiza kunzungidila vana disimu di mbu. Niandi va ndambu mbu kaba.<verse eid="MRK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>Buna mutu wumosi dizina diandi Yayilusi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yayilusi</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minsekuki minkaka misonika Yayilo va buangu ki Yayilusi. Tala Luka 8.41.</char></note>, wuba wumosi mu bapfumu zi nzo lukutukunu wuyiza vana. Bu kamona Yesu, wufukama va ntualꞌandi. <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>Wunleba ngolo ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:23">—Muanꞌama wunketo widi mu ziphasi zi lufua. Wundemvukila ; yizawuntetika mioko muingi kabeluka ayi kazinga !<verse eid="MRK 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Yesu wuyenda yandi va kimosi ayi nkangu wu batu wunlandakana ayi wumfietikisa mu zindambu zioso. <verse eid="MRK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Nketo wumosi wuba muna nkangu beni wuba kimbevo ki viokanga menga, kumi mimvu miodi kabedila kimbevo beni. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Wumona ziphasi ziwombo kuidi minganga miwombo ayi bima biandi bioso bimana mu diambu di kimbevo beni, kasia beluka ko vayi ziphasi ziluta buelama. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Bu kawa zitsangu zi Yesu, buna wuyiza, muna nkangu wu kaba, ku manima ayi wusimba nledi wu Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Bila wuyindula ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:28">—Minu simba kuandi minledi miandi mandi beluka kuama !<verse eid="MRK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Muna thangu yina kaka, menga malembolo buela vioka ayi wumona mu nituꞌandi ti belukidi mu nsongo wowo.<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Muna thangu yina, Yesu wubakula ti lulendo luandi lutotuka, wubaluka kuidi nkangu wu batu ayi wuba yuvula ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:30">—A nani simbidi minledi miama e ?<verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Minlonguki miandi minkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:31">—Wummona kuaku buevi nkangu wu batu balembo fietikisila mu zindambu zioso ayi weka buela yuvula : “Nani wutsimbidi e ?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Vayi niandi thalu andi yiba kaka kuidi nkangu muingi kazaba mutu vengi diawu. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Nketo wumona boma ayi weka tita. Bu kazaba diambu divangama mu nitu andi buna wufikama, wufukama va ntuala Yesu ayi wunkamba kiedika kioso.<verse eid="MRK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Buna Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:34">—A muanꞌama wunketo, minu kiaku kibelusidi ! Yenda mu ndembama ayi beluka kuaku mu ziphasi ziaku.<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Buna wukidi yoluka, ndambu yi batu baba ku nzo pfumu yi nzolukutukunu bayiza kunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:35">—Muanꞌaku wunketo fuidi. Bila mbi mu buela tatisa nlongi e ?<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Vayi Yesu bu kawa mambu batuba, wukamba pfumu yi nzo lukutukunu, ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:36">—Kadi mona boma. Wilukila kaka !<verse eid="MRK 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Bosi Yesu kasia vana ko minsua, kadi kuidi mutu wumosi, mu kunlandakana botula kaka Piela, zaki ayi khombꞌandi Yowani. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Buna batula ku nzo Pfumu lukutukunu, Yesu wumona divuda diba kuna : batu badila ayi bayamikina.<verse eid="MRK 5:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Buna wukota mu nzo ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:39">—A bila mbi divuda diodi e ? Ayi bila mbi lulembo didila e ? Muana kasi fua ko vayi leka kuandi kalekidi !<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Vayi bansekinina. Buna Yesu wutotula batu boso ku nganda. Wubonga dise ayi ngudi yi muana ayi minlonguki miomi miba yandi. Bawu bakota yandi muna khati vinga muba muana beni. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Wusimba koko ku muana ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:41">—Talita kumi ! Bu dinsundula : Muana ndumba ndikutumina kotuka !<verse eid="MRK 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Vana vawu muana ndumba wutelama ayi wudiata bila nduka-nduka kumi mimvu miodi miba yandi. Babo basimina ngolo. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Vayi Yesu wuba kandika babika kamba mambu beni kadi kuidi mutu wumosi ayi wuba kamba bamvana bidia.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Bavueza Yesu ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayi 13.53-58</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Buna Yesu wubotuka kuna ; wuvutuka ku tsi andi yika butukila ayi minlonguki miandi minlandakana. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Mu lumbu ki saba, Yesu wutona longa mu nzo lukutukunu. Buna bawombomu batu bobo banwa basimina ayi batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">—A kuevi kabakidi mambu momo e ? A phila nduenga mbi yoyibamveni e ? A buevi kalembo vangila bikumu biobi e ? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Niandi ko salaphati ; muana Maliya ; khomba yi Zaki, Yose, Yuda ayi Simoni e ? Bakhomba bandi zi baketo keti zikala yeto vava ? Niandi wuba nkaku kuidi bawu muingi babika wilukila.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Buna Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:4">—Mbikudi kantambulanga minzitusu ko mu tsi andi, kuidi bibutu biandi koayi mu dikanda diandi ko.<verse eid="MRK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Diawu kadi kumu kasia vanga kuna ko. Vayi botuka kaka ndambu bambevokatetika mioko ayi kabelusa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Wusimina buwombo mu kambu kuawu ku minu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu wutuma kumi mimvuala miandi miodi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1">Matayi 10.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:5-14">5-14</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu wudiengila mu mala ma zunga kina mu diambu di longa. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Wutumisa kumi mimvuala miandi miodi ayi wuba fidisa buadi-buadi. Wuba vana lulendo lu yadila ziphevi zimbimbi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>Wuba kamba babika nata kadi kima kimosi mu nzila botula kaka nti wutula va koko. Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:8">—Bu lunkuenda, lubika nata kadi khuta ; kadi nata khutu ; kadi nata zimbongo mu photimoni. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>Luvuata zisapatu mu malu vayi kadi nata kikhutu ki viakisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Yoso nzo bela ku luyakula, buna lukala muna nate luela kuenda. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Kioso buangu bela manga ku luyakula voti kuluwa ; buna muthangu luela botuka vana luba kukumuna mbungi-mbungi yi malu meno<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kukumuna mbungi-mbungi</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yinsundula ti basiedi mu kithuadi kimosi ko. Tala Matayi 10.14.</char></note>. Diodi diela ba kimbangi kuidi bawu.<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Buna bayenda ayi balonga batu ti babalula mavanga. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Bakuka ziphevi ziwombo zimbimbi ayi badukudila bambevo ziwombomafuta ayi baba belusa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufua lu Yowani Mbotiki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Matayi 14.1-2</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Ntinu Elode wuwa zitsangu zi Yesu, bila dizina diandi ditembakanamu zindambu zioso. Baba tubanga :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:14">—Yowani Mbotiki niandi wufulukidi mu bafua ! Diawu kadidi lulendo luvangilabikumu.<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Vayi bankaka baba tubanga :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">—Niandi Eli. Bankaka diaka ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">—Widi mbikudi banga wumosi mu mimbikudi.<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Vayi Elode bu kawa mambu momo, buna wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:16">—Yowani mutu ndizengisa ntu, niandi wufulukidi !<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:3-13">Matayi 14.3-13</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luka 3.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Muaki niandi veka Elode wuvana lutumunu mu buila yowani ayi wunkangisa mu zisieni mu nloko mu diambu Elode kakuela Elodiasi nketo nkhombꞌandi Filipi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Bila Yowani wuba kambanga ntinu Elode :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:18">—Wusi ko minsua mu kuela nketo khombꞌaku !<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Elodiasi wumfuemina ayi wuntombila diluaku di kumvondila. Vayi kasia nunga ko. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Bila Elode tsisi kaba monanga Yowani bila wuzaba ti Yowani wuba mutu wusonga ayi wunlongo. Diawu kaba ku nkebilanga bumbote. Bu kaba kunwanga buna wuba yindulanga buwombo ayi khini kaba monanga mu kunwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Vayi lumbu kimosi diluaku dimonika mu thangu Elode, mu lumbu ki nyengo wu mbutukulu andi ; kakubika nyengo wunneni wu ndiwulu, wutumisa bapfumu zioso zi leta, bapfumu zioso zi masodi ayi bapfumu zioso zi malamu zunga ki Ngalili muingi biza dia ku nzoꞌandi. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Mu thangu yi nyengo, muana ndumba wu Elodiasi wukota muna nzo, wukina. Wumonisa Elode khini va kimosi ayi batu boso Elode katumisa ku nyengo. Diawu ntinu kakambila muana ndumba beni :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">—Wundomba kioso tidi, ndieka kuvana kiawu. <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Wumvana tsila bu kaleva ndefi ti kioso kuandi wunlomba, yiba kuandi ti ndambu yi kipfumu kiama, ndieka kuvana kiawu !<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Muana ndumba beni wuyenda yuvula ngudi andi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">—A mbi ndomba e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Ngudi andi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">—Ntu wu Yowani Mbotiki !<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Buna muana ndumba wuvika vutuka nsualu kuidi ntinu ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:25">—Thidi mu nsualu wuphana buabu ntu wu Yowani Mbotiki mu dilonga.<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Ntinu wumona kiadi, vayi mu diambu di zindefi zi kaleva ayi batu bobo batumusu ; buna kasia zola kunyimina wawu ko. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Buna ntinu wufidisa disodi dimosi mu masadi momo maba kunsungangaayi wuntuma kanata ntu wu Yowani. Disodi beni diyenda kuna nloko ayi dizenga ntu wu Yowani. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>Dinata ntu beni mu dilonga ; divana wawu kuidi muana ndumba bosimuana wuyenda wuvana kuidi ngudi andi. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Minlonguki mi Yowani bu miwa nsamu, miyiza bonga nitu andi, mizika yawu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Mimvuala mikutakana vaba Yesu ayi mimvumbudila kipholo kimamo bavanga ayi balonga.<verse eid="MRK 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:31">—Yizanu va lutengo, va buangu kikambulu batu ayi luvunda fioti. Muaki batu bawombo baba kuendanga ayi kuizanga. Diawu basia bakila ko thangu yi dila bidia. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Diawu bakumina mu nlungu mu kuenda ku lutengo ; va buangu kikambulu batu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudikila mili tanu yi babakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayi 14.13-21</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:11-17">Luka 9.11-17</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-15">Yowani 6.1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Batu bawombo baba mona bu bayenda ayi baba bakula. Diawu batu bawombo baba mu mavula bazawula kuna ayi baba tuamina va buangu kioki baba kuenda. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yesu bu kakuluka mu nlungu ; wumona nkangu wu batu ; wuba mona kiadi bila baba banga mameme makambulu nsungi. Wutona kuba longa mambu mawombo.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Buisi buna bueka nduka yila, minlonguki miyiza kunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:35">—Va buangu kikambulu batu tuidi bosi buisi bueka yila. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Diawu vutula batu baba muingi benda mu ziphagu zi bibulu zitsola ayi mu mala mafikimini mu diambu benda sumbi bidia.<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Vayi Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">—Luba vananu beno veka bidia ! Vayi bawu banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">—Tidi tuenda sumbi mapha ma zikhama zizole zi denali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denali</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mfutu wu kisadi mu lumbu kimosi.</char></note> muingi tuba vana badia.<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yesu wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">—Mapha ma kua madi yeno e ? Yendanu lutala. Bu bazaba, buna bankamba : Mapha matanu ayi zimbizi zizole.<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Buna wuvana lutumunu mu vuandisa nkangu wu batu mu makabu, va biti binlangu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Batu bavuanda mu makabu ; mankaka khama yi batu, mankaka makumatanu ma batu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Bosi wubonga mapha beni matanu ayi zimbizi beni zizole, wuvumbulameso ku Yilu, wuvutula matondo ; wubukuna mapha, wuvana minlonguki muingimikabudila nkangu wu batu. Wubuela kabudila zimbizi zizole beni kuidi batu boso. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Batu boso badia ayi bayukuta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Batota kumi bipani biodi biwala mu bitini bi mapha ayi mu zimbizi ziozi zisiadidila. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Thalu yoso yi batu badia mapha yiba mili tanu yi babakala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.44 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mili tanu yi babakala</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayuda baba kifu kitanganga kaka babakala ; baba tanganga ko baketoayi bana balezi. Tala Matayi 14.21 ; Luka 9.14.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudiatila va mbata nlangu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayi 14.22-33</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yowani 6.16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Ku nzimunina Yesu wutuma minlonguki miandi mikuma mu nlungu muingi mintuaminina ku disimu dinkaka di mbu ku ndambu Betisayida ; niandi veka bu kaba vutula nkangu wu batu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Buna kamana vutula nkangu buna wuyenda ku mongo mu kuenda sambila.<verse eid="MRK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Buisi buna bueka yila, nlungu weka va ngingi mbu ; Vayi buna Yesu wukidi niandi veka ku disimu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Wumona ti minlonguki miandi milembo moni ziphasi ziwombo mu vuila mu diambu di phemo yiba kuba vutula ku manima. Yiba nduka-ndukathangu yinya yi builu. Yesu wuyenda ku baba vayi va mbata mbukaba diatila. Ayi wuzola kuba viokakana. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Vayi bu bammona wundiatila va mbata mbu, babanzila ti nkuyuayi diawu bayamikinina. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Bila baboso bammona ayi bamona boma. Vayi vana vawu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">—Bika luba bukhafi bila minu kuandi ; lubika mona boma.<verse eid="MRK 6:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Bosi wukuma mu nlungu mu baba ayi phemo yilembama. Minlonguki misimina ngolo, <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>bila misia sudika ko tsundu yi kumu ki mapha mu diambu di mintimamiawu miba mi matadi.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa bambevo ku Ngenezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayi 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Buna bamana sabuka mbu, batula ku zunga ki Ngenezaleti ; bakanga nlungu va dibongo. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Bu batumbu kuluka mu nlungu, batu babakula Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Buna batu beni bayenda nsualu mu zunga kioso. Bannatina bambevo mu biphoyi koso buangu bawa ti kuna kadi. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Mu bibuangu bioso kaviokila yiba mu mala, mu mavula voti mu zitsola batu batula bambevo mu mazandu, ayi, baba nlebanga Yesu muingi kaba vana kaka minsua mu simba kaka tsongi yi nledi andi. Babo bobo basimba wawu babeluka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayi kikhulu ki Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Matayi 15.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Bafalisi ayi ndambu yi minlongi mi mina baba ku Yelusalemi, bayiza kutakana vaba Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Bamona ti minlonguki miandi minkaka miba dia dipha ayi miokomi mvindu bu dinsundula mioko mikambu sukulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Bila Bafalisi ayi Bayuda boso balendi dia ko mu kambu tuama sukulabumbote mioko miawu ; buawu bobo baba kinzikilanga kikhulu ki bakulu bawu. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Ayi enati ku zandu babedi, balendi dia ko enati basi yobila ko. Bifu binkaka biwombo baba bikila kuidi bakulu bawu banga mu phila yisukudila zikopo, mimvungu ayi zinzungu zi bisengo. <verse eid="MRK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Diawu Bafalisi ayi minlongi mi mina bayuvudila Yesu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:5">—A bila mbi minlonguki miaku mikinzikanga ko kikhulu ki bakulubeto e ? Bila mbi beti dila ayi mioko mikambu sukulu e ?<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:6">—Beno luidi bankua mayuya ! Ezayi wubikula bumboti mu diambu dieno. Banga bu disonimina mu minkanda :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="qt">Batu baba mu tsongi zi bididi kaka beta kunzitisila</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="qt">vayi mintima miawu thama midi ayi minu.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>
    <char style="qt">Mu phamba kuandi balembo tsambidila</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="qt">bila malongi balembo longi madi zithumunu zikubuku kuidi batu.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Bila lueti loza Mina mi Nzambi ayi lueti kinzika kikhulu ki batu.<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Wubuela ku bakamba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:9">—Beno lueti vunzikisa Mina mi Nzambi muingi lukinzika kikhulu kieno. <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Bila Moyize wutuba ti : <char style="qt">Kinzika Dise diaku ayi ngudi aku, ayi woso wunsinga dise diandi votingudi andi kafueti baka thumbudulu yi lufua.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Vayi tala phila lueti tubila : woso wunkamba kuidi dise diandi voti kuidingudi andi ti : “Bima biabi ndiedi kaveni mu kusadisa bidi kolibani, budinsundula dikaba ditambuku kuidi Nzambi”, <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>ayi lueti vana minsua kuidi mutu wowo mu kambu sadisa dise diandi ayi ngudi andi. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Buawu bobo beno lueti vunzikisila Mambu ma Nzambi bu lueti kinzikakikhulu kieno kioki lueti kukilonga ayi lueti vanga mambu mawombo ma phila yoyi.<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Yesu wutumisa diaka nkangu wu batu ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:14">—Lungua beno boso ayi lusudika : <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Kuisi ko kima kidi ku nganda yi mutu kilenda sumuna mutu bu kikotidi mu khati mutu vayi biobi bieti totuka mu niandi biawu bieti kunsumuna. <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>[Enati mutu beki matu ma wila buna bika kawa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buku kiaki kisi ko kisonama mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Buna kabotuka vaba nkangu wu batu, Yesu wukota ku nzo ; bunaminlonguki miandi minyuvula muingi kaba kamba tsundu nongo yoyi katuba.<verse eid="MRK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:18">—Beno mamveno luisi ko diela e ? Lukadi zaba ti bibioso bidi ku nganda yi mutu bilendi kunsumuna ko bu bikotidi mu niandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Bila bikotanga ko mu ntimꞌandi vayi mu vumu binkuendanga bosibintotukanga ku nganda. Mu mambu momo buna Yesu wuvedisa bidia bioso.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Wubuela ku bakamba diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:20">—Vayi mantotukanga mu mutu, mawu meti sumuna mutu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Bila mu khati, mu ntima wu mutu, muawu mueti totukila mayindumambimbi meti nata mutu mu vanga mambu matsoni, mu yiba, mu vonda, <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>mu kitsuza, mu nzinunu, mu mambu mambimbi, mu luvunu, mu divunzi, mu kikhenene, ku bifingu, ku luniemo ayi ku mambu ma buvungisi ayi mambimbi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Mambu moso mama mambimbi mu khati ntima meti ba ayi mawu meti sumuna mutu.<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Minu ki nketo wukambulu Nyuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayi 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Yesu bu kabotuka vana, wuyenda mu zunga ki divula di Tile. Buna wukota mu nzo yimosi ayi kasia zola ko ti mutu kazaba. Vayi kasia baka busuamina ko. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Bila nketo wumosi, wuwa zitsangu ziandi ayi wuba ayi muanꞌandiwunketo wuyamusu kuidi pheve yimbimbi, wuyiza ayi wufukama va malu mandi. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>Nketo beni wuba muisi Ngelese, wubutukila ku Fenisi didi mu tsi Sili. Wuleba Yesu muingi katotula pheve yimbimbi yiba mu muanꞌandi wunketo.<verse eid="MRK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Vayi Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:27">—Bika theti bana batuama yukuta ; bila busi fuana ko mu bonga dipha di bana ayi lozila diawu zimbua.<verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Nketo beni wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:28">—Nyinga Pfumu, zimbua zidi ku tsi meza zieti dia bitsiedi-tsiedi biobi bana beti dodula.<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Buna Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:29">—Mu diambu di mvutu wowo, yenda kuaku ! Pheve yimbimbi yitotukidi mumuanꞌaku wunketo.<verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Bu kavutuka ku nzoꞌandi ; wuyenda bata muanꞌandi buna kalekidi va mbuka, pheve yimbimbi yitotukidingi kuandi.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa mutu wufua matu ayi wuba nkukumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Yesu bu kabotuka mu zunga ki Tila, wuviokila mu Sidoni ayi mu Dekapoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dekapoli</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinsundula kumi di mavula.</char></note> bu kayenda ku mbu wu Ngalili. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Bannatina mutu wumosi wufua matu ayi wuba yolukilanga mu phasi. Banleba muingi kantetika mioko. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yesu wubotula mutu beni va khatitsika nkangu, wunnata va lutengo, wutula minlembo miandi mu matu ; wulobula madita bosi wusimba ludimilu mutu beni. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Buna wuvumbula meso ku yilu, wuvumisa ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:34">—Efata ! Bu dinsundula zibuka kuaku.<verse eid="MRK 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Vana vawu matu ma mutu beni mazibuka ; ludimi luandilunianguka ayi wutona tuba bumboti. <verse eid="MRK 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Yesu wuba kandika babika kamba nsamu beni kadi kuidi mutu wumosi. Bu kaluta kuba kandika buna baluta tembikisa wawu.<verse eid="MRK 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Nkangu wu batu basimina ngolo ayi batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 7:37">—Mambu moso keti vanga madi mamboti ; weti zibula matu ma batu bafua matuayi weti yolukisa mababa !<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wudikila mili ya yi babakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayi 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Muna bilumbu beni, nkangu wu batu bawombo bakutakana. Sumbu basia ba kadi kidia ko, buna Yesu wutela minlonguki miandi ayi wuba kamba :<verse eid="MRK 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>—Kiadi ndimmona nkangu wu batu baba. Bila bilumbu bitatu bavuandidi yama vava ayi basi kadi kidia ko. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Enati ndibavutudi ayi nzala mu zinzo ziawu buna maba bua dibutumu nzila bila bankaka thama babedi.<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Minlonguki miandi mimvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:4">—Va buangu kikambulu batu tuidi, buna kuevi tulenda bakila maphamafueni mu dikila nkangu wu batu wawu e ?<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Yesu wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">—A mapha makua madi yeno e ?<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Buna Yesu wutumina batu boso bavuanda va tsi ; wubonga tsambuadi di mapha beni, wuvutula matondo, wubukuna mawu ayi wuvana mawu minlongukimiandi ayi miawu mikabudila nkangu wu batu. Buawu bobo mivanga. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Baba ayi ndambu bina bi zimbizi zifioti zi nlangu. Bu basakumuna biawu wuvana minlonguki miandi muingi mikabudila batu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Badia ayi bayukuta. Botota tsambudi di bipani mu bitini biobi bisiadidila. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Batu babo baba, nduka-nduka mili ya yi babakala. Bosi Yesu wuba vutula.<verse eid="MRK 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Muna thangu beni, Yesu wukota mu nlungu ayi minlonguki miandi, bayenda ku Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayi bapfumu zi zinganga Nzambi zi Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matayi 16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Bafalisi bayiza ayi batona kumfindisa ziphaka. Banlomba dimbu kimosikiba ku Diyilu mu diambu di kuntambila ntambu.<verse eid="MRK 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yesu wuvumina ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:12">—Bila mbi batu ba tsungi yayi bantombila dimbu e ? Bukiedika ndikulukamba tikadi dimbu kimosi balendi mona ko.<verse eid="MRK 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Wu babika, wukuma mu nlungu ayi wuyenda ku disimu dinkaka.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayi 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Minlonguki mizimbakana nata mapha ; dipha dimosi kuandi kaka diba yawu muna nlungu.<verse eid="MRK 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Vayi wuba lubula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:15">—Lukeba ayi luzibula meso mu luvi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Luvi</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala tsudukusu mu matayi 13.31.</char></note> lu Bafalisi ayi lu Elode !<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Minlonguki miyuvusana miawu na miawu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:16">—Mu diambu tukambulu mapha diawu kantubila bobo !<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Yesu wuzaba mayindu mawu ayi wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:17">—Bila mbi lulembo kukiyuvula beno na beno mu diambu lukambulu mapha e ? A beno, lusudikidi ko e ? Ayi lubakudi ko e ? Mintima mieno mikidi banga matadi e ? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Meso madi yeno vayi lukadi mona e ? Makutu madi yeno vayi lukadi wa e ? Lukadi buela tebuka moyo e ? <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Bu ndibukuna mapha matanu mu diambu di mili tanu yi batu, bipani bikua lutota biobi biba biwala mu bitsadisila e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Bamvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">—Kumi bibiodi. <verse eid="MRK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Bu ndikabula tsambuadi di mapha mu diambu di mili ziya zi batu. A bipani bikua lutota biobi biba biwala mu bitsiadisila e ? Bamvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">—Tsambuadi.<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Buna wubuela diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:21">—Vayi nate buabu lusudikidi ko e ?<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa phofo ku Betesayida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Bu batula ku Betesayida banata phofo kuidi Yesu, banleba muingi kansimba.<verse eid="MRK 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yesu wusimba phofo beni mu koko, wunnata ku fula di buala, wulobula madita mu meso ma phofo beni ; wuntetika mioko ayi wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:23">—Lembo moni kima e ?<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Phofo wutala ayi wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:24">—Ndimmona batu, banga minti mindiata.<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Yesu wubuela tetika mioko miandi mu meso ma phofo beni. Bosi Phofo weka mona ; wubeluka ayi wumona bumboti bima bioso.<verse eid="MRK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Yesu wumvutula ku nzoꞌandi. Vayi wunkamba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:26">—Kadi kota ku buala.<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">YESU AYI MINLONGUKI MIANDI</para>
  <para style="s1">Piela wutelimina Yesu kimbangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayi 16.13-20</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yesu ayi minlonguki miandi miyenda mu mala ma Sezale mu Filipi. Mu nzila, wuyuvula minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:27">—Batu beti tuba ti minu ndidi nani e ?<verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Bamvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:28">—Bankaka widi Yowani Mbotiki ; bankaka widi Eli, ayi bankaka widiwumosi mu mimbikudi.<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Buna wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">—Vayi beno veka lueta tuba ti minu ndidi nani e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Piela wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">—Ngeyo widi Klisto.<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Vayi wuba kandika babika yolukila diawu kadi kuidi mutu wumosi.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyolukila lufua luandi ayi mfulukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-23">Matayi 16.21-23</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luka 9.22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Bosi wutona kuba longa ti Muana mutu kafueti mona ziphasi ziwombo, bila bakulutu, bapfumu zi zinganga Nzambi, minlongi mi mina, baboso bobobela kunloza ; bela kumvonda vayi bilumbu bitatu bu biela vioka, niandi wela fuluka. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Wuba kamba mambu moso mama mu kambu sueka kadi diambu. Buna Piela wunnata va ndambu ayi wutona kuntubidila.<verse eid="MRK 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Vayi Yesu wubaluka ayi wutala minlonguki miandi, weka ntubidila Piela mu kingolo ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:33">—Satana ! Botuka va ndidi ! Bila mayindu maku masi ko ma Nzambi vayi ma kimutu.<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buevi bu landikinina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Matayi 16.24-28</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luka 9.23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Yesu wutumisa nkangu wu batu ayi minlonguki miandi, wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:34">—Enati mutu tidi kundandakana buna kafueti kukizimbakana niandi veka vayi kabonga dikulusi diandi ayi kandandakana. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Bila woso tidi keba luzingu luandi wela luzimbisa, vayi woso wela luzimbisa mu diambu diama ayi mu diambu di Nsamu wumboti, wela luvukisa. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Enati mutu beki nza yimvimba vayi zimbisidi muelꞌandi, buna ndandu mbi kela baka e ? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Voti mu kima mbi mutu kalenda sombikisa muelꞌandi e ? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Bila woso mutu wukumfuila tsoni ayi wumfuila mambu mama tsoniva khatitsika tsungi yayi yi bankua kitsuza ayi yi bankua masumu, buna muana mutu mamvandi wela kumfuila tsoni mu thangu kela kuiza mu nkembo wu dise diandi va kimosi ayi zimbasi ziandi zinlongo.<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Ayi wubuela diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:1">—Bukiedika ndikulukamba : batu bankaka badi vava balendi ba fuako nate bela mona Kipfumu ki Nzambi kinkuizila mu lulendo.<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wukituka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-9">Matayi 17.1-9</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Bilumbu bisambanu bu bivioka, Yesu wubonga Piela, Zaki ayi Yowani, wuba nata va bawu veka, va lutengo, va mbata mongo wumosi wunda. Wukituka va ntualꞌawu ; <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>minledi miandi mitona lezama ayi mieka miphembi dio ve. Kuisi ko mutu va ntoto wumvimba beki buvedisila minledi muingi miba phembi yi phila yina <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Tumbu zimbukila Eli ayi Moyize baba monikina ; bansolula ayi Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Buna Piela wukamba Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:5">—A Nlongi ! Bulutidi mbote tukala kueto vava ! Bika tutunga zinzozitatu zikapu : yimosi mu diambu diaku, yimosi mu diambu di Moyize, yimosi mu diambu di Eli.<verse eid="MRK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>Bukiedika kasia zaba ko diambu dituba bila bawu boso boma baba mona.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Buna dituti dimosi dimonika ayi diba fuka. Mbembo yimosi yitotuka mu dituti beni, yiwakana :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:7">—Niandi, niawu muanꞌama wu luzolo, lunwila !<verse eid="MRK 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Muna yina thangu, minlonguki bu mitala ku ndambu ayi ndambu misia buela mona Moyize ayi Eli ko vayi Yesu kaka wusiala yawu.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Bu baba nengumuka mongo, Yesu wuba vana lutumunu ti babikakamba mambu mama bamueni kadi kuidi mutu wumosi nate Muana Mutu kelafuluka mu bafua. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Balunda mambu beni vayi bayuvasana bawu yi bawu tsundu yi “fuluka mu bafua”.<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Matayi 17.10-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Buna banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:11">—A bila mbi minlongi mi Mina mieta tubila ti Eli kafueti tuama kuiza theti e ?<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:12">—Bukiedika Eli kafueti tuama kuiza ayi wela kubika mambu moso. Vayi bila mbi disonimina mu minkanda ti Muana Mutu wela mona ziphasi ziwombo ayi wela sekonono e ?<verse eid="MRK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Vayi minu ndikulukamba ti Eli wuyiza vayi bamvangila mambu bosobubela luzolo luawu banga bu disonimina mu diambu diandi.<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa muana wuba pheve yimbimbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayi 17.14-21</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Buna batula kuba minlonguki ; bamona nkangu wu batu wuba zungidila ayi milembo findana ziphaka ayi minlongi mi Mina. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Vana vawu nkangu wu batu buna wumona Yesu, wusimina ngolo. Buna batu boso bazawula mu diambu bamvana mbote.<verse eid="MRK 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Buna wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:16">—A diambu mbi lulembo findinina yawu ziphaka e ?<verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Mutu wumosi wuba muna nkangu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:17">—A Nlongi, ndinatiningi muanꞌama wu bakala widi pheve yi dibaba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Mu kioso kuandi buangu Pheve yimbimba yawu kumbuila, yeti kuntutumuna ngolo ayi weti totula difulu mu munu ; weti kueta meno, bosi nitu yifueti mana kangama. Khembi minlonguki miaku muingi mikuka pheve beni vayi misi nunga ko.<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:19">—Tsungi yikambulu minu ! Zithangu zikua ndiela kadila yeno va kimosi e ? Zithangu zikua ndiela buela kangila ntima mu bila kieno e ? Lundatina niandi.<verse eid="MRK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Bantuadila muana beni. Pheve yimbimbi bu yitumbu mona Yesu, yitutumuna muana beni ; muana wulumbama va tsi ; muana wumvindumuka va tsi. Difulu dieka ntotuka va munu.<verse eid="MRK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesu wuyuvula dise diandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">—Tona thangu mbi katonina mona ziphasi ziazi e ? Dise diandi divutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">—Tona mu bumuana buandi. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Zikhumbu ziwombo Pheve beni yimbimbi yeti kunlumba ku mbazu voti mu nlangu muingi yimvonda. Enati wulenda vanga diambu, bunabika wutumona kiadi, wutusadisa !<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:23">—Enati wulenda ! Mambu moso malenda vangama kuidi woso mutu wilukidi !<verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Vana vawu dise di muana diyamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:24">—Nguilukidi, wutsadisa mu kambu kuama ku minu.<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesu bu kamona ti nkangu wu batu wulundumuka, buna wutemina pheveyimbimbi ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:25">—A Pheve yimbimbi yeti kanga mbembo ayi matu ma muana, minu ndikutumina : Totuka mu muana wawu ayi muisi ko thangu mu buela vutuka mu niandi.<verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Pheve yimbimbi yiyamikina, yitutumuna muana beni, bosi yitotuka. Muana beni weka banga wufua. Diawu batu boso baba vana batubila : “Yimeni, fuidi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Vayi yesu wunsimba mu koko, wuntedimisa, bosi muana beni wutelama.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Yesu bu kakota mu nzo, minlonguki miandi mieka kunyuvula va bawu veka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:28">—A bila mbi beto tusi nunganga ko mu kuka pheve yoyo e ?<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:29">—Pheve yi phila yayi yeti totukila kaka mu lusambulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">minkanda minkaka misonika : pheve yi mpila yayi yeti totukila kakamu lusambulu ayi mu kukifuisa nzala mu lusambulu.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuela yolukila lufua luandi ayi mfulukulu andi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayi 17.22-23</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Babotuka muna zunga beni, baviokila ku Ngalili. Yesu kasia zola ko ti mutu ka buzaba <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>bila minlonguki miandi kaba longo ; wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:31">—Muana Mutu wela yekolo mu mioko mi batu. Bela kumvonda. Vayi bilumbu bitatu bu biela vioka, wela fuluka mu bafua.<verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Vayi minlonguki misia sudika ko tsundu malongi beni, bosi boma miba mona mu kunyuvula biuvu.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nani lutidi munneni mu kipfumu ki Diyilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayi 18.1-5</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Batula ku Kafalinawumi. Yesu bu kaba muna nzo, buna wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:33">—A mambu mbi lulembo findininanga ziphaka mu nzila e ?<verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Baboso baba dio sui ! Bila bu baba mu nzila, bafindasana bawu nabawu ziphaka mu diambu di zaba nani muna badi lutidi munneni.<verse eid="MRK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yesu wuvuanda, wutumisa Kumi mimvuala miodi ayi vuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:35">—Enati mutu tidi ba wutheti, buna kaba wutsuka mu batu boso ayikaba kisadi ki batu boso.<verse eid="MRK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Bosi wubonga muana lezi, wuntelimisa va khatitsikꞌawu. Buna kambonga mu mioko miandi bosi wuba kamba :<verse eid="MRK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>—Woso wunyakula muana lezi wuphila yayi mu dizina diama, minu kuandi kayakudi. Ayi woso mutu wundiakudi buna bika sia ti minu kaka kayakudi vayi yakudi diaka mutu wowo wuthuma.<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Bosi Yowani wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:38">—Nlongi, tumueningi mutu wumosi wuntotula ziphevi zimbimbi mu dizinadiaku vayi tunkandikidingi bila katulandakananga ko.<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:39">—Lubika kunkandika, bila kuisi ko mutu weti vanga kumu mu dizinadiama ayi zimbukulu weka kuthubidila mambu mambimbi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Bila woso wukambu bumbeni kuidi beto buna ku ndambu eto kadi. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Tala, bukiedika ndikulukamba : woso kuandi mutu wukuluvana banza ti kopoyi nlangu mu dizina diama bila luidi batu ba Klisto, kalendi zimbisa ko mfutu andi.<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-11">Matayi 18.6-11</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>Ayi wubuela tuba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:42">—Woso mutu wumbuisa mu masumu wumosi mu bana balezi baba betikunguilukila, bulutidi mboti bankanga, mu tsingu, ditadi dinneni diodi beti nikina zitheti bosi banloza mu mbu.<verse eid="MRK 9:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Enati koko kuaku kulembo buisi mu masumu buna zenga kuawu bila mboti wukota mu luzingu ayi koko kumosi ayi kuenda ku bulungi, kuidi mbazuyizimanga ko ayi mioko miodi miduka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:43">[<verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>Kuna zimvidi ziawu zilendi fua ko ayi mbazu yilendi zima ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mambu mama masi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Enati kulu kuaku kulembo buisi mu masumu, buna zenga kuawu bilamboti wukota mu luzingu ayi kulu kumosi ayi mu lozo ku bulungi ayi malu muadi maduka. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>Kuna zimvidi ziawu zilendi fua ko ayi mbazu yilendi zima ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mambu mama masi ko mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Enati dieso diaku dieti kubuisa mu masumu, buna dovula diawu bila mboti wukota mu Kipfumu ki Nzambi ayi dieso dimosi ayi mu lozo ku bulungi ayi meso muadi maduka ; <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>kuna zimvidi ziawu zilendi fua ko ayi mbazu yilendi zima ko.<verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Bila kadika mutu wela kitulu lueki mu mbazu banga tsalu bu yinkitudilanga bidia lueki. <verse eid="MRK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>Tsalu kima kimboti vayi ti yisiedi ko lueki, buna buevi lulenda vutudila diakalueki luandi e ? Diawu bika luba tsalu mu beno veka ayi zingilanganu mu ndembama beno na beno.<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="ms1">KISALU KI YESU MU YUDA AYI KU YELUSALEMI</para>
  <para style="s1">Ziphasi mu diambu di vonda dikuela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayi 19.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Yesu wubotuka kuna mu kuenda mu zunga ki Yuda ayi ku ndambu yinkakayi Yolidani. Nkangu wu batu wubuela kutakana va kaba ayi wutona kuba longabanga boso bu kayuku.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Bafalisi bayiza kuidi niandi mu diambu bamfiela, bana banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:2">—Minsua midi kuidi bakala mu botula nketo andi va makuela e ?<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Niandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:3">—Moyize mbi kalutumina e ?<verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Bankamba ti : <char style="qt">Moyize wuvana minsua mu sonika nkanda luvambanu mu vonda dikuela ayi mu kuka nketo andi.</char><verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:5">—Moyize wulusonikina lutumunu lolo mu diambu di mintima mieno midi banga matadi <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>vayi vana thonono Nzambi wubavanga bakala ayi nketo.<verse eid="MRK 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>
    <char style="qt">Diawu bakala kela bikila dise diandi ayi ngudi andi mu bundana ayi nketo andi,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/><char style="qt">buna bawu buadi bela kituka nsuni wumosi.</char> Buna basiedi diaka batu buadi ko vayi beka nsuni wumosi kaka.<verse eid="MRK 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Diawu mutu kabika vambisa kibundisa Nzambi.<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Bu baba diaka mu nzo, minlonguki minyuvula diaka mu diambu di mambu beni. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:11">—Mutu niandi botula nketo andi va makuela ayi kuedidi nketo wunkaka, vengi kitsuza kuidi nketo wutheti. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Bosi enati nketo botukidi va makuela, ayi kuedidi bakala dinkaka, buna vengi kitsuza.<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutambula bana balezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayi 19.13-15</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Banatina Yesu bana balezi muingi kaba tetika nioko vayi minlonguki mitemina batu bobo babanata.<verse eid="MRK 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Vayi bu kamona bobo ; wufuema ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:14">—Lubika bana bafioti biza kuidi minu ayi kadi kuba kandika ; bila kipfumu ki Nzambi kivuiwilu kuidi bobo baba dedikini. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba, woso mutu wummanga tambula Kipfumu ki Nzambibanga muana lezi, kalendi baka ko bu kotila mu Kipfumu beni.<verse eid="MRK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Vana vawu wubonga bana ba lezi, wuba tetika mioko ayi wuba sakumuna.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zimvuama ayi Kipfumu ki Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayi 19.16-30</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Bu kaba kuenda, mutu wumosi wuyiza fukama mu nsualu ku ntualꞌandi ayi wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:17">—Nlongi wumboti, diambu mbi phanga muingi ndibaka luzingu lukalumani e ?<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:18">—Bila mbi wukuthedila wumboti e ? Kuisi ko mutu widi wumboti. Nzambi kaka widi wumboti. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>Vayi ngeyo zebi zithumunu : <char style="qt">kadi vonda, kadi vanga kitsuza, kadi yiba, kadi tuba kimbangi ki luvunu, kadi vangila mutu mbimbi, kinzika dise diaku ayi ngudi aku.</char><verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Mutu beni wunkembi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:20">Nlongi, ndieti sadila mambu momo tona mu bumuana buama !<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesu wuntala, wunzola ayi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:21">—Diambu dimosi kaka dikambulu yaku : yenda, sumbisa bima bioso bidi yaku ayi vana kuidi minsukama. Buna ma wubaka kiuka mu Diyilu, bosi yiza ayi wundandakana.<verse eid="MRK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Bu kamana wa mambu momo, mutu beni wutumbu vonga, wuyenda ayi kiadi mu ntima bila kimvuama kiwombo kiba yandi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Buna Yesu wuzungisa thalu mu zindambu zioso ayi wukamba minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:23">—Didi diambu di phasi kuidi batu bobo badi kimvuama mu kota mu kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Minlonguki misimina buwombo mu diambu di mambu mandi. Vayi Yesu wubuela bakamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:24">—Bana, ziphasi ziwombo zidi mu kota mu Kipfumu ki Nzambi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minkanda minkaka mieti buela kuidi bawu bantulanga mayindu mawu mu kimvuama.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Bukiedika kadi kuandi phasi kuidi kamela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kamela</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bulu kidi banga phunda. Kikubuku mu natanga bizitu mu dikanga ayi kizebi nuanlangu wuwombo.</char></note> mu viokila va divudu di tsoma vayi bika kuidi mutu widi kimvuama mu kota mu Kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Minlonguki misimina ngolo ayi bayuvasana bawu na bawu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:26">—A buna nani wulenda vuka e ?<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesu wuba tala ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:27">—Kuidi batu malendi baka bu vangiminina ko vayi bika kuidi Nzambi bila kuidi Nzambi mamo malenda vangama.<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Diawu Piela kanyuvudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:28">—Tala, beto tumana bika bima bioso ayi tulandakana !<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:29">—Bukiedika ndikulukamba, kadi mutu wumosi wubikidi nzo, bakhomba bandi zi babakala, bakhomba bandi zi baketo, ngudi andi ; dise diandi, bana bandi voti zitsola ziandi mu diambu diama ayi mu diambudi Nsamu Wumboti, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>Wela kambu baka mu thangu yayi yi tuidi : zinzo, bakhomba zi babakala ayi zi baketo, zingudi, bana ayi zitsola va kimosi ayi yamusu vioka zikhama zi zikhumbu. Bosi mu thangu yela kuiza, wela baka luzingu lukalumani. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Vayi batu bawombo mu bobo badi batheti bela ba batsuka, bosi, bobo badi batsuka bela ba batheti.<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubuela yolukila lufua ayi mfulukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayi 20.17-19</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Bu baba mu nzila mu kuenda ku Yelusalemi, Yesu ku ntuala kaba. Minlonguki misimina, batu bobo baba landakana bamona boma. Buna Yesu wubonga diaka kumi mimvuala miandi miodi ayi wutona kuba kamba mambu momo mafueti kumbuila. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:33">—Lutala, tulembo yendi ku Yelusalemi, vayi kuna Muana Mutu kela yekodolo mu mioko mi bapfumu zinganga ayi kuidi minlongi mi Mina. Bela ku nzengila nkanu wu lufua ayi bela ku nyekula mu mioko mi Bapakanu. <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Bela kunsekinina, bela kunlobudila madita, bela ku mbeta bikoti ayi bela kumvonda. Vayi bilumbu bitatu bu biela vioka, wela fuluka mu bafua.<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zaki ayi Yowani balomba buangu ki nzitusu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayi 20.20-28</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:25-27">Luka 22.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Buna Zaki ayi Yowani, bana ba Zebede, bayiza fikama vaba Yesu, bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:35">—A Nlongi ! Tutidi wutuvangila mambu momo tueka ku lomba.<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:36">—A diambu mbi lutidi ndiluvangila e ?<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Bamvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:37">—Mu thangu wela ba mu nkemboꞌaku, bika wumosi kaba vuanda va lubakala luaku, wumosi va lumoso luaku.<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Vayi Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:38">—Beno lusi zaba ko mambu momo lunlomba ! Buna beno lulenda nua mbunguyoyi ndiela nua e ? Voti buna lubotimini mbotama yoyi mfueti botama e ?<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Bamvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">—Tulenda kueto !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">—Luela nua kueno mbungu yoyi ndikuiza nua ayi luela botama mbotama yoyi ndikuiza botimina ! <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Vayi mu diambu di vuanda va lubakala luama voti va lumoso luama, diodi disi kuthala ko. Bila bibuangu beni bidi mu diambu di batu bobo bakubukulu biawu.<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Thangu kumi di mimvuala minkaka miwa mambu momo, mifuemina Zaki ayi Yowani.<verse eid="MRK 10:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Bosi Yesu wuba tumisa bawu boso, wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:42">—Luzebi ti bobo bammonikanga ti bapfumu zi Bapakanu zieta kuba tuminanga mu kingolo ayi batu bawu baluvalu beti kuba yadila. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Vayi kuidi beno, buawu ko bufueti bela. Bila woso tidi ba wunneni vakhatitsikꞌeno buna bika kaba kisadi kieno. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Ayi woso tidi ba wutheti buna luidi, bika kaba mvika wu batu boso. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Bila Muana Mutu kasia kuiza ko muingi bansadila vayi wuyiza mu diambudi sadila ayi vana luzingu luandi mu diambu di kula bawombo.<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wubelusa Balitime</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayi 20.29-34</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Bosi batula ku Yeliko. Mu thangu Yesu, va kimosi ayi minlonguki miandi ayi nkangu, bu batotuka mu Yeliko buna Balitime, muana bakala wu Time, wuba phofo ayi wuba wuvuanda mu myenda nzila ayi zimbongo kaba lombanga. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Buna kawa ti niandi nina Yesu muisi Nazaleti, wutona yamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:47">—A Yesu ! Muana Davidi, wumbona kiadi !<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Bawombo bantemina muingi kabika biyoko. Vayi niandi wulutabuela yamikina ngolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:48">—A Muana Davidi ! Wumbona kiadi !<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yesu wutelama ayi wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">—Luntela ! Batela phofo ayi bakamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">—Ba bukhafi ! Telama ! Ngeyo kantela.<verse eid="MRK 10:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Wuloza yunga kiandi, wutumbu telama, wuyenda nsualu kuidi Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesu wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">—Diambu mbi tidi ndivangila e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Phofo wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">—A Nlongi, thidi mona !<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Buna Yesu wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">—Yenda, minu kiaku kibelusidi !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Vana vawu Balitime wumona ayi wulandakana Yesu mu nzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutambulu mu nkembo ku Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayi 21.1-11</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19.28-40</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yowani 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Mu thangu bafikama ku Yelusalemi, buna beka nduka tula ku Betifange ayi ku Betani ku ndambu mongo minti mi Olive ; Yesu wutuma minlonguki miandi miodi ayi <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:2">—Yendanu ku buala bobo buidi ku ntualꞌeno, beno tula, buna ma lumona muana phunda wukangama, kadi mutu kawudiatidi ko. Lunianguna wawu ayi lutuala wawu. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Vayi enati mutu wuluyuvudi : “Bila mbi lumvangila bobo e ?”, buna lunkamba : “Pfumu mfunu kawuvuidi”. Buna wela kuwufila nsualu vava.<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Bayenda, bamona muana phunda beni buna wukangimini va ndambu muelo, ku nganda, mu yenda nzila. Bawu nianguna.<verse eid="MRK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Batu bankaka baba vana bayuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:5">—A mbi biobi lumvana e ? A mu diambu di mbi luniangunina muana phunda wowo e ?<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Bavutula banga boso Yesu kabatumina. Batu beni bababika benda kuawu.<verse eid="MRK 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Banata muana phunda beni kuidi Yesu ; bayala minledi miawu vambata muana phunda beni, ayi, Yesu wuvuanda va mbata muana phunda beni. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Batu bawombo bayala minledi miawu mu nzila, bankaka bayala matafi maminti momo bazenga mu zitsola.<verse eid="MRK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Batu bobo baba ku ntuala ayi bobo baba ku mbusa baba yamikinanga :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">
    <char style="qt">Ozana !</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">
    <char style="qt">Bika kasakumunu mutu wowo wunkuizila</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">
    <char style="qt">mu dizina di Pfumu !</char><verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>
    <char style="qt">Bika kisakumunu Kipfumu kioki kinkuiza,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">
    <char style="qt">kipfumu ki nkuluꞌeto Davidi</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">
    <char style="qt">Ozana mu bibuangu binzangama.</char><verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesu bu kakota ku Yelusalemi, wuyenda mu Nzo Nzambi. Bu kazungisa thalu andi mu bima bioso, wuyenda ku Betani va kimosi ayi kumi minlonguki miandi miodi mu diambu di thangu yeka kielo.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusinga nti wu figi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayi 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Mu lumbu kilanda, bu batotuka mu Betani, Yesu wumona nzala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Buna wukidi thama, wumona nti wumosi wu figi wuba meza mamboti. Wufikama mu tala kani lenda mona muna makundi. Vayi bu kafikama vaba nti, meza na meza kaka kamona, bila yisia ba tsungi yi makundi ma figi ko.<verse eid="MRK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Buna Yesu wukamba nti wu figi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">—Kadi mutu kalendi buela dia dikundi di nti aku ko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Minlonguki miandi miwa bu katuba mambu momo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu mu Nzo Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayi 21.12-17</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19.45-48</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yowani 2.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Buna bayetula ku Yelusalemi, Yesu wukota ku luphangu lu Nzo Nzambi, ayi wukuka batu bobo baba sumbisa bima ayi bobo baba sumba bimamuna luphangu lu Nzo Nzambi. Wusengubula zimeza zi batu bobo baba sienzanga zimbongo ayi bikundu bi bobo baba sumbisanga mabembi. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Ayi wukandika ti kadi mutu wumosi kabika buela viokisila mimfuna mu Nzo Nzambi.<verse eid="MRK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Buna wutona longa ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:17">—Tala Disia sonama ko ti <char style="qt">bela tedilanga nzo ama Nzo yi lusambulu mu diambu di batu boso e ? Vayi beno lukitudi yawu nsuku wu mivi.</char><verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Bapfumu zi zinganga Nzambi ayi minlongi mi Mina bu bawamambu momo kavanga, batomba nzila yi kumvondila. Bila boma baba kummonamu diambu di nkangu wu batu boso simina wuba simina mu diambu di malongi mandi.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Bu batula va masika, Yesu ayi minlonguki miandi batotuka mu divula.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lulendo lu minu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayi 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Mu nsuka wu lumbu kilanda bu baba viokila vana, bamona nti wufigi wumeni yuma nate muna mianzi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Piela wutebuka moyo mu mambu mavioka, wukamba Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:21">—A Nlongi ! Tala nti wu figi wowo wusingidi wuyumini !<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesu wuvutula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:22">—Bika minu kieno kiba mu Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba, enati mutu kembi kuidi mongo wawu : “botuka vava, wukilozi mu mbu” ayi enati kakadi memeta mu ntimꞌandivayi wilukidi ti mambu momo kakembi mafueti kaka vangama, buna diambu beni difueti kaka vangama. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Diawu ndikulukambila ti dioso kuandi diambu di lunlomba mu lusambulu, luwilukila ti lutambudi diawu, ayi, luela mona ti divangimini.<verse eid="MRK 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Vayi mu thangu lutidi sambila enati mutu beki ndiandi diambu, bikakanlemvukila muingi dise dieno didi ku Diyilu niandi mamvandi kalulemvukila mu zinzimbala zieno. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>Vayi enati lumengi lemvukila, buna dise dieno didi ku Diyilu kalendi kululemvukila ko mu zinzimbala zieno<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buku kiaki kisi ko mu minkanda minkaka mi khulu.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balenza kipfumu ki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayi 21.23-27</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Bosi batula diaka ku Yelusalemi. Yesu bu kaba ndiengila mu luphangu lu nzo Nzambi, bapfumu zi zinganga Nzambi, minsoniki ayi bakulutu ba batu bayiza kuidi niandi. <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>Banyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:28">—Mu lulendo mbi wulembo vangila mambu momo e ? Ayi nani wuveni lulendo beni e ?<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:29">—Thidi ku luyuvula kiuvu kimosi ; enati lupheni mvutu, buna bosi minu mamvama ndieka kulukamba mu lulendo lu nani ndilembo vangilanga mambu momo. <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Nani wuvana Yowani minsua mu botika, Nzambi voti batu e ? Luphana mvutu.<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Bayindula, bawu na bawu ayi bakamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:31">—Enati tukembi ti “Nzambi” buna maka tuyuvula : “Vayi buna bila mbi lukambu kunwilukila e ?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Vayi enati tuvutudi ti “Batu”…</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:32">Batu baba mona boma bilabatu boso bawilukila ti Yowani wuba mbikudi wukiedika.<verse eid="MRK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Buna bavutudila Yesu ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">—Tuisi zaba ko. Yesu mamvandi wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">—Minu mamvama ndilendi kulukamba ko kani mu lulendo lu nani ndilembo vangila mambu mama.<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Nongo yi minkuni mimbimbi mi ndima yi vinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayi 21.33-46</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Buna wutona kuba tubila mu zinongo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:1">—Mutu wumosi wukuna ndima yi vinu ayi wutungila yawu luphangu. Wukaba dibulu dimosi mu kamuninanga makundi ma vinu ayi wutunga nzo yimosi yi banga mu diambu di sunganga ndimꞌandi. Bosi mutu beni wuyekula ndima beni mu mioko mi minkuni muingi miyifutilanga. Bosi wuyenda mu nzietolo.<verse eid="MRK 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Thangu yi mvedolongo mimbutu bu yifuana, buna wutuma kisadi kiandi kimosi kenda landi ndambu makundi mandi ma vinu kuidi bisadi bi ndima. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Vayi bisadi bi ndima bikanga mutu beni ayi bintuta khuba bosi bimvutula mioko na mioko. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Pfumu yi ndima wubuela tuma kisadi kinkaka. Banlueka ku ntu bosi bamfinga. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Pfumu yi ndima wubuela tuma kisadi kintatu, bamvonda. Bosi wubuela tuma bisadi binkaka biwombo, binkaka bitutu khuba ayi binkaka bivondo.<verse eid="MRK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Pfumu yi ndima wusiala ayi mutu wumosi. Mutu beni muanꞌandi wowoketi luta zola. Ku nzimunina niandi wuba wutsuka mu fidisu bu katuba : “Bela kinzika Muanꞌama”. <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Vayi minkuni mi ndima mikambasana bawu na bawu : “Taleno mutu wowo wela vinginina kiuka, yizanu tumvonda muingi kiuka kikituka kieto.” <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Buna mimbuila, mimvonda ayi minloza ku nganda ndima vinu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Buna Pfumu ndima mbi kela vanga e ? Niandi veka wela kuiza, wela vonda minkuni miomi ayi wela defisa ndima beni kuidi minkuni minkaka. <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>Lusia tanga ko masonuku mama :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="qt">Ditadi diodi diloza mintungi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="qt">dikituka ditadi di mfunu di fuma ki nzo</char><verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>
    <char style="qt">Pfumu niandi wuvanga buawu</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="qt">ayi didi diambu ditsiminanga mu meso meto !</char><verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Buna batomba diluaku di kangisila Yesu. Bila bazaba kuawu ti bawu Yesu kavekula vayi boma baba mona nkangu wu batu. Diawu basia kumbikila ayi bayenda kuawu.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ziphaka mu diambu di phaku yi Sezali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayi 22.15-22</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Batuma ndambu yi Bafalisi ayi batu ba dikabu di Elode biza kuidi Yesu mu diambu di tomba diluaku di kumbuidila mu mambu momo kalenda tuba niandi veka.<verse eid="MRK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Bayiza kunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:14">—A Nlongi, tuzebi ti ngeyo kiedika, wumonanga mutu boma ko bila wutalanga bizizi bi batu ko ; weti longa nzila yi Nzambi mu kiedika. Diawu wutukambi, minsua midi mu futa phaku kuidi Sezali voti nana e ? Tufuta voti tubika futa e ?<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Vayi Yesu wuzaba mayuya mawu ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:15">—Bila mbi lunkumfiedila e ? Luthuadila denali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Denali</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yiba zimbongo zi bisengo. Yawu yiba mfutu wu kisadi bu kasedi lumbu kimvimba mu ndima. Tala mu Matayi 18.28.</char></note> kimosi muingi ndikitala.<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Bannantina kiawu ayi wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">—A zizi kinani kiaki ayi bisono biabi bi nani e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Bamvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">—Bi Sezali !<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Buna Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">—Diawu luvana bi Sezali kuidi Sezali ; bi Nzambi kuidi Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Babo bansimina ngolo.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ziphaka mu diambu di mfulukulu yi bafua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayi 22.23-33</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Bosi Basaduki, batu bobo beti tuba ti bafua balendi fuluka ko, bayiza kuidi Yesu ayi banyuvula :<verse eid="MRK 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>—Nlongi, Moyize wutusonikina ti <char style="qt">Bakala dikuela bu kafuidi, enati kasia buta bana ko, buna khombꞌandi kafueti vinginina nketo wowo kabikidi muingi kabuta bana mu diambu di khombꞌandi wufua.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Vaba tsambuadi di bakhomba zi babakala, Muana wutheti wukuela nketo, wufua vayi kasia buta bana ko. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Wumuadi wuvinginina nketo beni. Niandi mamvandi wufua, kasia butabana ko. Buawu bobo buvangimina kuidi khomba yintatu, <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>nate tsambuadi yoso bakuela nketo beni, vayi basia buta kadi muanako. Kunzimunina, nketo beni mamvandi wufua. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Buna mu lumbu kimfulukulu, nketo beni wela ba wunani e ? Bila tsambuadi yoso yinkuela.<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:24">—Lulembo kukivuni. Bila lusi zaba masonoko ko ayi lusi zaba ko lulendo lu Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Bila batu bafua bu bela fuluka, batu balendi buela kuelana ko ayi kuedisa ko, vayi bela ba banga zimbasi mu Diyilu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Vayi mu diambu di mfulukulu yi bafua, lutengi ko mu buku yi Moyize mu diambu di nti wu zitsendi phila Nzambi kanyolukila ti : <char style="qt">Minu ndidi Nzambi yi Abalahami ; Nzambi yi Isaki ayi Nzambi yi Yakobi.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>Nzambi kasi Nzambi yi batu bafua ko, vayi Nzambi yi batu badi moyo. Diawu mu nzimbala yinneni luidi !<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muina wulutidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayi 22.34-40</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Nlongi wumosi wu Mina wuba wa mu thangu baba findasana ziphaka. Bu kamona ti Yesu wuvutudila bumboti Basaduki, wuyiza fikama va kaba, bosi wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:28">—Mu Mina mioso, Muina mbi wulutidi mfunu e ?<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:29">—Muina wulutidi mfunu wawu wawu : Wa Iseli, Pfumu niandi Nzambi eto, niandi kaka Nzambi ; <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>diawu zola Pfumu Nzambi aku mu ntimꞌaku wumvimba, mu muelꞌakuwumvimba, mu mayindu maku moso ayi mu zingolo ziaku zioso. <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Tala Muina wummuadi wudedikini banga wutheti : zola ndiakubanga bu weti kukizodila ngeyo veka. Kuisi ko Muina wunkaka wuviokidi Mina miami.<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Nlongi beni wu Mina wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:32">—Nlongi, mambu kembi madi makiedika bila Pfumu Nzambi widi wumosi kaka, kuisi ko wunkaka ; <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>zola Nzambi mu ntimꞌaku wumvimba, zola Nzambi mu diela diaku dioso ayi mu zingolo ziaku zioso ayi zola nkundi aku banga bu wukukizodilanga, diviokidi yokila Nzambi dikaba ayi kumvana mintindu mioso mi makaba ma mfunu.<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yesu wumona ti mu diela kavutudila, diawu kankambila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">—Wisi thama ko ayi kipfumu ki Nzambi !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Momo bu mavioka, kadi mutu kasia buela kunyuvula biuvu ko.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ziphaka mu diambu di Klisto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayi 22.41-46</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Yesu bu kalonga muna luphangu lu Nzo Nzambi, wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:35">—A buevi minlongi mi Mina mintubilanga ti Klisto Muana Davidi e ? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Bila niandi veka Davidi bu katuadusu kuidi pheve Yinlongo, wutuba :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="qt">Pfumu wukamba kuidi Pfumuꞌama</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="qt">vuanda va koko kuama ku lubakala.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="qt">Nate mbeni tula bambeni ziaku</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="qt">ku tsi bitambi biaku.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Diawu, enati niandi veka Davidi wuntedila Klisto “Pfumu”, buna buevi kafueti buela bela muanꞌandi e ? Nkangu wu batu wuwila Yesu mu khini.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wutumbudila minlongi mi Mina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-12">Matayi 23.1-12</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Wutuba mu malongi mandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:38">—Lulubukila minlongi mi Mina. Bila bawu khini beti monamu diatilanga mu mazuela manda ayi beti zola baba vaninanga mbotimu bibuangu bidi batu bawombo. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Bayuku vuandilanga mu bibuangu bidi ku ntuala muna zinzozi lukutukunu, ayi mu bibuangu bi nzitusu mu minyengo. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Vayi beti yiba zinzo zi mafuola ayi beti sambila zitsambulu zinda muingi bamonika kuidi batu. Bela tambula thumbudulu yilutidi ngolo.<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Difuola divana makaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Bosi Yesu wuyenda vuanda va ndambu ; va talana ayi pani ki makaba kiba muna nzo Nzambi. Ayi wuba talanga phila yoyi batu baba tudilanga zimbongo mu pani. Zimvuama ziwombo zitula zimbongo ziwombo. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Ku nzimunina kuyiza nsukami wumosi wu nketo, wuba difuola, wuyiza mamvandi mu vana makaba, wutula kaka bivangi biodi bifioti-fioti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bwanzi beni biawu biluta keva mu luvalu mu bwanzi bioso zi bisengo.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Buna Yesu wutela minlonguki miandi ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:43">—Bukiedika ndikulukamba, nsukami wawu wu nketo, difuola diadi, niandi lutidi vana zimbongo mu pani viokila batu boso <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>bila batu boso baveni zimbongo, ziosi zibakambulu vua mfunuvayi niandi mu sukama kuandi veni zizioso zibedi yandi ziozi, kafueti zingila.<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyolukila ziphasi ziela buila Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-3">Matayi 24.1-3</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-7">Luka 21.5-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Yesu bu katotuka mu Nzo Nzambi, nlonguki andi wumosi wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 13:1">—A Nlongi ! Tala matadi mama ma kitoko ayi zinzo zikitoko !<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 13:2">—Nyinga, tala bumboti zithungulu ziazi ; kadi ditadi dimosi dilendi ba siala ko va mbata ditadi dinkaka, mamoso mela tiolomono.<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Bu kavuanda va mbata mongo minti mi Olive, mongo wowo wuntalananga ayi Nzo Nzambi buna Piela, Zaki, Yowani ayi Andele banyuvula va bawu veka :<verse eid="MRK 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>—Wutukambi thangu mbi mambu beni mela vangimina e ? Bosi dimbu mbi kiela monisa ti thangu yifueti vangimina mambu beni yifueni e ?<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:4-14">Matayi 24.4-14</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 21:8-19">Luka 21.8-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yesu wutona kuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 13:5">—Lukeba luedi vunu kuidi mutu ! <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Bila bawombo bela kuizila mu dizina diama buna bela tuba ti : “Minu kuama” ayi bela vuna bawombo.<verse eid="MRK 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Mu thangu luela wa zitsangu zi zimvita ayi biyoko bi zimvita bunalubika ba tita ; bila mambu beni mafueti kaka vangama. Vayi yawu ko yela ba tsukulu yi nza. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Bila tsi yimosi yela nuanisa tsi yinkaka, batu ba Kipfumu kimosi belanuanisa batu ba Kipfumu kinkaka ayi ntoto wela nikuka mu bibuangu biwombo. Nzala yela ba yiwombo. Vayi yoyi yela ba kaka thonono yi minsongo.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>Diawu lulubuka mu diambu di beno veka ! Bila bela ku lufunda ku mu ntilubinadu wu Bayuda ayi bela kulu beta bikoti mu nzo zi zikhutukunu, luela samba va ntuala minyadi ayi va ntualamintinu mu diambu diama. Yoyi yela ba nzila mu kuba natina kimbangi. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Vayi tuamina mamo, Nsamu Wumboti wufueti teka mana longo kuidibatu ba makanda moso. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Vayi mu thangu luela natu va ntuala bapfumu muingi lusambusu, lubika ba ba mayindu mu diambu di mambu momo luela tuba. Vayi lutuba kaka moso mambu mela lukuizila bila bika sia ti beno luela yoluka, vayi pheve Yinlongo yela yoluka.<verse eid="MRK 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Khomba yela yekula khombꞌandi mu diambu bamvonda ayi dise diela yekula muanꞌandi ; bosi bana bela fuemina bambuta ziawu ayi bela kuba vondisa. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Bosi batu boso bela lulenda mu diambu diama. Vayi woso mutu wela kanga ntima nate kuna tsukulu wela vuka.<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayi 24.15-28</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21.20-24</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 17:23-25">17.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>Bu luela mona mbungi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mbungi</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baklisto ba luvunu bawu bobo beti kukidedikisanga banga Klisto.</char></note> telimini va buangu kioki kikalendi telama ko, [bika mutu wowo wulembo tangi kasudika,] buna boso batu bela batakana mu tsi Yuda, batinina ku miongo. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Woso mutu widi ku mbata muanzu, kabika kuluka mu nzo ayi kabikamu kota mu diambu di totula ka diambu ko kima kimosi. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Woso mutu wela batakana mu tsola, kabika buela vutuka ku nzo mu bonga yunga kiandi.<verse eid="MRK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Mabienga mela ba mu bilumbu bina kuidi baketo bela ba mu buemba ayi kuidi bobo bela yemika. <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>Lusambila muingi mambu beni mabika bela mu tsungi yi kiozi kingolo. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Bila mu bilumbu, bina ziphasi zingolo ziela ba, nkutu ziphasizina zibedi ko tona thonono yi nza ayi ziphasi zi phila yina zilendi buela ba ko. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Enati Pfumu kasia baka ko lukanu lukufisa bilumbu beni, nganu kadi mutu wumosi kalendi vuka ko. Vayi wukufika biawu mu diambu di batu bobo kasobula. <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>Enati mutu wulukembi : “Lutala Klisto widi vava” voti “widi kuna !” Lubika kunwilukila. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Bila ba Klisto baluvunu ayi mimbikudi mi luvunu miwombo mielatotuka ayi bela vanga bidimbu binneni ayi bikumu bitsisi muingi babakabu vunina enati baka bubela batu bobo Nzambi kasobula. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Tala, ndilulubudi.<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndizulu yi Muana Mutu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-35">Matayi 24.29-35</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>Ziphasi zi bilumbu beni bu ziela manisa, buna</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="qt">thangu yela tumbu nomba ;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="qt">ngondi yela zimbisa miezi miandi</char><verse eid="MRK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>
    <char style="qt">zimbuetete ziela doduka tona mu diyilu nate va ntoto</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">
    <char style="qt">ayi lulendo lu diyilu luela nikuka.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>Buna bosi bela mona Muana Mutu wela kuizila mu matuti mu lulendo loso ayi mu nkembo wunneni. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Wela tuma zimbasi ziandi mu zitsongi zioso ziya zi ntoto mu kutikisa batu boso bobo Nzambi kasobula va nza yimvimba, tona ku tonina nza nate ku sukinina nza.<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>Bika buabu lulonguka dilongi di nti wu figi. Enati matafi mandi mekamalebila ayi matonini totula meza, buna luzebi ti thangu mvula yifikimini. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Beno mamveno bobuawu, buna luela mona mambu moso momo buna luzaba ti Muana Mutu weka nduka kuiza, banga ti niandi weka va muelo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti tsungi yayi yilendi kiviokila ko tuamina mambu moso mama mavangama. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Diyilu ayi ntoto biela vioka vayi Mambu mama malendi vioka ko.<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukubamanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-42">Matayi 24.36-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>Vayi mu diambu di thangu voti lumbu kiela vangama mambu beni, kadi mutu wumosi kasi zaba ko ayi zimbasi zisi zaba ko. Ka diambu ko Muana Mutu kasi zaba ko. Niandi veka Tata zebi.<verse eid="MRK 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:42">Matayi 24.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>Lulubuka, luleka nkielo ayi lusambila bila lusi zaba ko thanguyela vangimina mambu momo.<verse eid="MRK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Mambu beni mela vangimina banga mutu wubika nzoꞌandi mu kuendamu nzietolo ayi wusia vana minsua kuidi bisadi biandi ; kadika kisadiayi kisalu kiandi. Wusia kamba satinela kasunganga bumboti. <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>Diawu beno mamveno, luleka nkielo. Bila lusi zaba ko thangumbi yela vutukila pfumu nzo : kani va masika, kani va midi miphipa votiva thangu yinkokulanga tsusu, voti, va nsuka. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Bila buisi fuana ko kiza lubati buna luledi tulu enati niandi wizidi mu kinzimbukila. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Mambu mama ndilukembi, khembi mawu kuidi batu boso. Luleka nkielo.<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="ms1">LUFUA AYI MFULUKULU YI YESU</para>
  <para style="s1">Bayendila Yesu manenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayi 26.1-5</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22.1-2</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yowani 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Buna bilumbu biodi bisiala muingi nyengo wu Pasika wuba ayi nyengo wowo Bayuda baba dianga mapha makambu siwu luvi. Bapfumu banganga Nzambi ayi minsoniki baba tombanga buevi balenda kangila Yesu mu luvunu muingi bamvonda. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Bila batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:2">—Tubika bu vanga mu thangu yi nyengo, muingi khindu yibika bua mu batu.<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Badukudila Yesu malasi ku Betani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayi 26.6-13</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yowani 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesu bu kaba ku Betani, ku nzo Simoni mutu wowo wuba kimbevo ki buazi ; mu thangu kaba va meza, nketo wumosi wuyiza ayi bungu kimosikivangulu mu ditadi di alabatele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">alabatele</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">phila ditadi diodi baba vangilanga malonga, zikopo zi mbudi-mbudiayi bima binkaka bieti budika. Tala Matayi 26.7.</char></note> kiwala malasi ma nale<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nale</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kunusu kiba vangulungu malasi ma kitoko.</char></note> makambu sobukusu, maba malasi mathalu. Wubula ntu wu bungu beni ayi wudukula malasiku ntu Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Batu bankaka baba vana basia mona ko khini diawu baniungutila bawu na bawu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:4">—Bila mbi bunga malasi momo e ? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Nganu mboti mu sumbisa mawu viokila zikhama zitatu zidenali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zikhama zitatu zidenali</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">thalu yoyi yidi thalu yifueti futu kisadi mu tezo ki mvu wumvimba.</char></note>, bosi vana zimbongo beni kuidi minsukami. Diawu batubidila buwombo nketo beni.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Vayi Yesu wuba kembi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:6">—Lumbikanu ! Bila mbi lulembo kummonisina phasi e ? Diambu kaphangidi didi diambu di mboti. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Bila minsukami mikala kuandi yeno mu zithangu zioso ayi lulenda kueno kuba vangila mamboti mu zithangu zioso zilutidi, vayi minu ndilendi kuiza kalanga ko yeno mu zithangu zioso. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Nketo wawu vengi diambu kalenda vanga ; wukivindidi nituꞌama malasi mu diambu di kubika nzikuluꞌama. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti muamo muela longo Nsamu Wumboti va nza yimvimba, diambu divengi nketo wawu diela yolokolongo ayi diela tebokolongo moyo mu diambu diandi.<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda kayekula Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayi 26.14-16</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Buna, wumosi mu kumi mimvuala miodi, dizina diandi Yuda Isikalioti, wuyenda kuidi bapfumu zi zinganga Nzambi muingi kasumbisa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Bu bawa bila kikayizila, bamona khini ayi bamvana tsila yi kumvana zimbongo. Diawu kaba tombilanga diluaku difuana di kuba yekudila Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayi minlonguki miandi badia Pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Matayi 26.17-19</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Mu lumbu kitheti ki nyengo wu mapha makambu tulu luvi, lumbu kioki beti vonda muana dimemi mu dia mu Pasika, minlonguki minyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:12">—Kuevi tidi tuenda kubikila ndiwulu yi Pasika e ?<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Buna wufidisa minlonguki miandi miodi ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:13">—Yendanu ku divula, maludengana mutu wumosi neti mvungu wunlangu, buna lunlandakana. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Yoso nzo yika nkota buna lukamba kuidi pfumu yi nzo beni ti : “Nlongi wututumini muingi tuyuvula : Kuevi kuidi vinga kiama kiokimfueti dila Pasika ayi minlonguki miama e ?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Buna ma kalumonisa vinga kidi ku yilu banga ; vinga beni kikubuku ayi kidi kinneni. Kuawu ma luvangila khubukulu mu diambu dieto.<verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Minlonguki miandi miyenda. Mitula ku divula ayi miyenda bata mamo banga bu kambila Yesu. Bosi mikubika bidia bi Pasika.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayi 26.20-25</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:14">Luka 22.14</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yowani 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Mu thangu masika, Yesu wuyiza ayi kumi mimvuala miodi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Mu thangu baba dia va meza, Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:18">—Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti buna luidi vava mutu wumosi mu beno, mutu wowo wundia yama va kimosi, weka kunduekula.<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Baboso beka mona kiadi, wumosi-mosi weka kunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:19">—Buna minu e ?<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Yesu wuba vutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:20">—Wumosi mu kumi mimvuala miodio ; mutu wowo wumbuika tini kiandi va kimosi mu dilonga ayi minu. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Bila Muana mutu wulembo yendi banga busonimina mu masonuku mu diambu diandi vayi mabienga kuidi mutu wowo wunkumvakula ! Nganu bufueni kuidi mutu beni mu kambu kuandi butuka.<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayi 26.26-30</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luka 22.15-20</ref> ; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinto 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Mu thangu baba dia, Yesu wubonga dipha wudisakumuna, wudibukuna mu bitini ayi wuvana minlonguki miandi ayi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:22">—Bonganu, yayi yawu nituꞌama.<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Bosi wubonga mbungu, wuvutudila Nzambi matondo, wuba vana yawu. Bawu boso banua. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:24">—Mama mawu menga mama, menga ma Nguizani, madukulu mu diambu di batu bawombo. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Bukiedika ndikulukamba ti ndilendi buela ko nua vinu nate mu lumbu kioki ndiela nua vinu mu phila yinkaka mu Kipfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Bu bamanisa yimbila nkunga. Batotuka mu kuenda ku mongo minti mi olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusamuna ti Piela wela kuntunuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayi 26.31-35</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22.31-34</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yowani 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yesu wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:27">—Beno boso luela nikunu mu minu bila disonama ti :</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="qt">Ndiela beta nsungi mamemi</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="qt">ayi mamemi moso mela mana tiakana.</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Vayi bu ndiela fuluka, ndiela ku lutuaminina ku Ngalili.<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Piela wunkamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:29">—Ka diambu ko baboso bela nikunu mu minu vayi minu ndilendi ko.<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:30">—Bukiedika ndikukamba, buabu kuandi va builu, sumbu tsusu yinkuiza kokula mu zikhumbu zizole, ngeyo mawu thunukina mu zikhumbu zitatu !<verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Vayi Piela wuvutula mu ngolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">—Ka diambu ko ; fua, ndifua yaku vayi ndilendi kutunuka ko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Baboso phila yimosi batubila.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wusambila ku Ngetesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayi 26.36-46</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:40-46">Luka 22.40-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Bosi batula ku buangu beti tedila Ngetesemane. Yesu wukamba minlonguki miandi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:32">—Lukala vava minu, ndiedi ku sambila.<verse eid="MRK 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Wunata Piela, Yowani ayi Zaki. Wutona mona kiadi ayi maniongo. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Bosi wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:34">—Muelꞌama weka kiadi nate nduka mu fua. Lusiala vava ; luleka nkielo.<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Wuyenda thama fioti, wufukama ayi wuyinika zizi mu tsi, wusambila Nzambi ti baka bubela muingi thangu yoyi yintatukila.<verse eid="MRK 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Buna wutuba : Aba ! Tata ! Kuidi ngeyo mambu moso malenda vangama. Thatudila mbungu yayi. Muaki bika sia ti boso bunzodidi vayi boso bu zodidi !<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Wuvutuka vaba minlonguki miandi. Wuyenda babata balembo lekitulu. Buna wukamba Piela :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:37">—A Simoni, wulembo leki e ? Wusi nunga ko mu leka nkielo mu thangu yimosi ko e ? <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>Luleka nkielo ayi lusambila muingi luedi bua mu phukumunu. Bila pheve yidi ayi luzolo lu mboti vayi nitu yidi yilebakana.<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Wuyenda diaka ayi wubuela sambila lusambulu banga lolo katuama sambila. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Bu kavutuka diaka, wuyiza buela babata buna balekidi bila mesomatulu maba yawu. Basia baka diambu di nkumvutudila ko.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Bu kavutuka mu khumbu yintatu, wuba kamba ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:41">—Lukidi leka ayi lulembo vundi e ? Bufueni. Thangu yifueni. Muana Mutu yekolo mu mioko mi bankua masumu. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>Telamanu ! Tuendianu ! Bila mutu wowo wukundiekula fikimini.<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakanga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayi 26.47-56</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22.47-53</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:2-11">Yowani 18.2-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Buna kamanisini ko yoluka, tala Yuda, wumosi mu kumi mimvuala miodiwuyiza va kimosi ayi nkangu wu batu banata zimbedi ayi zimbondo, batumu kuidi bapfumu banganga Nzambi, minsoniki ayi kuidi bakulutu ba Bayuda.<verse eid="MRK 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Yuda, mutu wuyekula Yesu, wuba vana dimbu kiaki :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:44">—Woso mutu ndikuiza fifi besi buna niandi ; lufueti kanga ayi lunnata bumboti.<verse eid="MRK 14:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Yuda bu katula, wufikama vaba Yesu bosi wuntela : “A mueni Nlongi !” Bosi wumfifa besi.<verse eid="MRK 14:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Buna bosi bambuila ayi bankanga. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Vayi mutu wumosi mu bawu baba vana, wutotula mbedi andi, wuzuba kisadi kimosi ki pfumu yi zinganga Nzambi ayi wunzenga dikutu.<verse eid="MRK 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesu wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:48">—Ndieka dovula muingi luiza khangi ayi zimbedi ayi zimbondo zi minti mu mioko e ? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Keti bilumbu bioso ndibedi kalanga yeno va kimosi, ndibedi longangamu Nzo Nzambi ayi lusia kukhanga ko. Vayi mambu moso mama mavangimini mu diambu di dedikisa masonuku.<verse eid="MRK 14:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Mu thangu beni, baboso basia kumbika ayi batina.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Ditoko dimosi divuata kaka diphiya di nledi, niandiwunlandakana. Bu bankanga, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>wuyekula diphiya beni ayi pheni nkua katina.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Basambisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayi 26.57-68</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-14">Yowani 18.12-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Banata Yesu kuidi pfumu yi banganga Nzambi, kuna ku kutakana bapfumuzioso zi banganga Nzambi, bakulutu ba dibundu ayi minsoniki. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Piela wunlandakana kuna manima, nate ku luphangu lu pfumu yi banganga Nzambi. Wuvuanda va kimosi ayi minsungi va muenda mbazu yi bayota. <verse eid="MRK 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Bapfumu banganga Nzambi ayi batu boso ba lukutukunu lunneni batomba kimbangi mu diambu di Yesu muingi babaka bila ki kumvondisila vayi basi baka ko. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Bila bawombo batuba bimbangi bi luvunu mu diambu diandi, vayibimbangi beni bisia dedakana ko.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Buna ndambu yi batu bankaka batelama mu telama kimbangi ki luvunu, bawu bakamba :<verse eid="MRK 14:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>—Tunwa bu katuba ti : “Ndiela tiolumona Nzo Nzambi yayi yitungulu mu mioko mi batu vayi mu bilumbu bitatu, ndiela tungayinkaka yoyo yela kambu tungulu mu mioko mi batu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Vayi ka diambu ko batuba bobo, bimbangi biawu bisia dedakana ko.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Buna pfumu yi banganga Nzambi wutelama va khatitsika batu boso ; wuyuvula Yesu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:60">—Kadi diambu wukadi vutula e ? Kimbangi mbi kioki batu baba balembo kutelimina e ?<verse eid="MRK 14:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Vayi Yesu kasia vutula kadi diambu ko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Pfumu yi banganga Nzambi wunyuvula diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">—Ngeyo widi Klisto, Muana wu mutu wowo wusakumunu e ?<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:62">—Nyinga, ndidi Klisto ! Ayi luela mona Muana Mutu vuendi va koko ku lubakala lu Nzambi, nkua lulendo boso ayi luela mona phila kela kuizila mu nkembo mu matuti.<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Buna Pfumu yi banganga Nzambi, wukanzuna minledi miandi ayi wukamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:63">—Bila mbi tufueti buela tombila bambangi bankaka e ? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Beno veka luwilu phila kavuezidi Nzambi. Beno buevi lumbanzila e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Babo banzengila nkanu wu lufua.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Buna bankaka banlobudila madita, bamfukidila busu bosi banzuba zikhomi ayi bankamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:65">—A ngeyo, bikula e !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:65">Bosi minsungi minnata ayi mimbeta.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Piela wutunuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayi 26.69-75</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22.56-62</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-27">Yowani 18.15-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Mu thangu Piela kaba ku ndimba, ku khati luphangu, kisadi kimosi ki nketo kiba nsalanga kuidi pfumu yi banganga Nzambi kiyiza. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Bu kamona Piela wunyota mbazu, wunsungamana mboti ayi wukamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:67">—Ngeyo Mamvaku bedingi va kimosi ayi Yesu muisi Nazaleti !<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Vayi Piela wutunuka kuandi ayi wukamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:68">—Ndisi zaba ko ayi ndikadi sudika mambu momo wuntuba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:68">Bosi wutotuka ku nganda, wuyenda telama ku ndambu muelo wu luphangu. Muna thangu beni tsusu yikokula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Minkanda minkaka mikambulu nzila yayi : “Muna thangu beni tsusu yikokula”.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Kisadi beni ki nketo bu kamona diaka Piela, weka kamba batu bobo baba vana :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:69">—A beno ! Mutu wowo widi wumosi mu batu bana !<verse eid="MRK 14:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Vayi Piela wubuela tunuka diaka. Buela kala fioti, batu bobo baba vana, bakamba Piela :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">—Bukiedika ti ngeyo widi wumosi mu batu bobo bila widi muisi Ngalili.<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Buna wutona kukitombila tsingulu ayi wuleva ndefi ti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:71">—Ndisi zaba ko mutu wowo lulembo yolukila.<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Muna thangu beni, tsusu yikokula mu khumbu yimmuadi. Bosi Piela keka ntebukila moyo mambu makamba Yesu ti : “Sumbu tsusuyinkuiza kokula mu zikhumbu zizole, ngeyo mawu thunukina mu zikhumbu zitatu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:72">Bu kayindula bobo buna wudila ngolo.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Pilatu wusambisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:11-26">Matayi 27.11-26</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23.1-5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">13-25</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-40">Yowani 18.28-40</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:4-16">19.4-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Muna nsuka bapfumu banganga Nzambi, bakulutu ba dibundu, minlongi mi Mina ayi batu babo ba lukutukunu lunneni bakutakana. Bakanga yesu, bannata ayi banyekula mu mioko mi Pilatu.<verse eid="MRK 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilatu wunyuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">—Ngeyo widi Ntinu wu Bayuda ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesu wumvutudila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">—Ngeyo veka tubidi buawu !<verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Bosi bapfumu banganga Nzambi zimvubudila mambu mawombo. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Pilatu wunyuvula diaka :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:4">—Wulendi vutula kadi diambu ko ? Wulembo wi mambu momo balembo kumfundila ?<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Vayi Yesu kasia vutula diaka kadi diambu dimosi ko. Buna Pilatu wusimina ngolo.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Kifu kiba yawu mu thangu nyengo, Pilatu wuba totulanga mutu wumosi mu nloko, woso mutu wuba nlombongo kuidi batu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Vayi mutu wumosi wuba mu nloko, dizina diandi Balabasi, wukangu va kimosi ayi bakundi bandi bu batotula khindu. Muna khindu beni bavondila mutu.<verse eid="MRK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Nkangu wu batu wuyamikina, wunlomba kavanga banga bobo keta ku bavangilanga.<verse eid="MRK 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilatu wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:9">—Lutidi ndilutotudila Ntinu wu Bayuda e ? <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Bila wuzaba mboti ti bapfumu banganga Nzambi zinyekudila Yesumu diambu di kikhenene. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Vayi bapfumu banganga Nzambi zikambisila nkangu wu batu ti wulomba katotula Balabasi.<verse eid="MRK 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilatu wuba yuvula e ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:12">—A vayi mbi lutidi phangila mutu wowo luntedilanga ntinu wu Bayuda ?<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Babo babuela yamikina :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:13">—Wumbanda va dikulusi !<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilatu wuba yuvula :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">—Diambu mbi di mbimbi kavengi e ? Vayi baluta yamikina ngolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">—Wumbanda va dikulusi !<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Pilatu wuzola monisa nkangu wu batu khini, diawu kabatotudila Balabasi. Bu kamana zubisa Yesu bikoti ayi wuba yekudila niandi muingi bambanda va dikulusi.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Masodi masekinina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayi 27.27-31</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yowani 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Masodi manata Yesu ku luphangu, buangu kioki beti sambisila batu, bakutikisa masodi moso. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Bamvuika yunga kimbuaki. Buna bamana vanga phu ki kipfumu ki zitsendi ; bamvuika kiawu ku ntu.<verse eid="MRK 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Buna bamvana mboti :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:18">—Mbote, ntinu wu Bayuda !<verse eid="MRK 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Baba kunzubanga nti ku ntu, banlobudila madita ayi bamfukiminaayi baba kumvananga minzitusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Buna bamana kunsekinina, bamvula yunga beni kimbuaki ayibamvuika minledi miandi ; bosi bannata ku nganda muingi bambanda va dikulusi.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayi 27.32-44</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23.26-43</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:16-24">Yowani 19.16-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Mutu wumosi muisi Silene, dizina diandi Simoni, dise di Alekizandele ayi Lufusi, wuba ku nsitu. Vioka kuandi kaba mviokila mu nzila beni. Vayi masodi buna mammona, mankuika kanata dikulusi di Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Banata Yesu va buangu kintedulungu “Ngolongota”. Tsundu Ngolongota “buangu ki mvesi wu ntu.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Kuna bamvanina vinu kisobokoso ayi mila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mila</char><char style="fqa" closed="false"> : </char><char style="ft" closed="false">vinu kiawu sobokoso ayi mila kinkitukanga banga nkisi wunsadilanga minganga mu thangu opelasio.</char></note> muingi kanua, vayi kasia kinua ko. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Bu bambanda va dikulusi, bakabana minledi miandi, babudila miawutsombo mu diambu di zaba miomi kadika mutu kafueti tambula.<verse eid="MRK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Yiba nduka-nduka thangu yi vua yi nsuka mu thangu bambanda va dikulusi.<verse eid="MRK 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Tini ki dibaya kisonama bila kioki bamfundila, kisonama mambu mama : “Ntinu wu Bayuda”.<verse eid="MRK 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Bidovula biodi bibandu mu makulusu va kimosi ayi Yesu ; wumosi ku koko ku lubakala, wunkaka ku koko ku lumoso. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>Buawu bobo budedikinina mambu momo masonama mu Minkanda : <char style="qt">“Bantula mu nkangu wu batu bambimbi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buku kiaki kikambulu mu minkanda minkaka.</char></note><char style="qt">.</char>”]<verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Batu bobo baviokila vana, bamfinga, banikuna mintu ayi bakamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:29">—E e ngeyo ! Ngeyo wuntiolumunanga Nzo Nzambi ayi wukuyitungilanga mu bilumbu bitatu ! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Wukivukisa ngeyo veka ; bosi kuluka va dikulusi !<verse eid="MRK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Bapfumu banganga Nzambi ayi minlongi mi mina mamvawubansekinina. Bakambasana bawu na bawu :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:31">—Wuvukisidi batu bankaka vayi niandi veka kalendi kukivukisa ko ! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Bika Klisto ntinu wu Iseli kakuluka buabu va dikulusi muingi tumona ayi tuwilukila ! Bobo babandu yandi va dikulusi, mamvawu bamfinga.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayi 27.45-56</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23.44-49</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:25-30">Yowani 19.25-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Mu thangu midi, tombi kibua mu tsi yimvimba, kizingila natemu thangu yi ntatu yi masika.<verse eid="MRK 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>—Mu thangu yintatu, Yesu wuyamikina mu ndinga yingolo :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:34">—<char style="qt">Eloyi, Eloyi, lama sabakatani ! Bu dinsundula : Nzambi ama ! Nzambi ama ! Bila mbi wundiekudi !</char><verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Batu bankaka baba vana bu bawa bobo batuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:35">—Tala Eli kantela.<verse eid="MRK 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Wumosi wuzawula ayi wuyenda buika tini ki eponzi mu vinu ki ngami, wukisomika va tsongi nti ayi wutambika Yesu muingi kanua ; bu katuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:36">—Bika, tutala kani Eli makiza nkulula.<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Vayi Yesu wuyamikina ngolo ayi wuzenga vumunu.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Muna thangu beni lido yi Nzo Nzambi yikanzuka mu zindambuzizole ; tona ku yilu nate ku tsi.<verse eid="MRK 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Nkulutu wu masodi, wutalana ayi Yesu, bu kamona ti wutabukavumunu mu yamikina bobo, buna wutuba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:39">—Bukiedika, mutu wawu bedi Muana Nzambi !<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Vaba diaka ayi ndambu yi baketo baba ntadilanga ku thama. Mu bawu muba : Maliya muisi Mangadala, Maliya ngudi yi Zaki di nleki wu Yose ayi ngudi yi Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Bawu baba kunlandakananga, baba kunsadisanga mu thangu kaba ku Ngalili. Baketo bankaka bawombo bayiza yandi va kimosi ku Yelusalemi baba vana.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bazika Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayi 27.57-61</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23.50-56</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yowani 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Mu thangu masika, mu lumbu ki khubumunu, buna lumbu kimosi kisiedimuingi lumbu ki saba kiba. <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Zozefi muisi Alimate wuyiza. Wuba mutu wunneni mu lukutukunu lunneni lu Bayuda. Niandi mamvandi wuba vingilanga ndizulu yi Kipfumu ki Nzambi ; wuyenda mu bukhafi boso kuidi Pilatu mu kunlomba nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pilatu wusimina bu kawa ti Yesu fuidingi. Buna wutumisa pfumu yi masodi ayi wunyuvula keni thama kafuidingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Bu kawa buawu kuidi pfumu yi masodi, buna wuvana Zozefi minsua mu bonga nitu yi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Zozefi bu kasumba dikendi diphembi di thalu, wubotula mvumbi yi Yesu va dikulusi, wuyizinga va dikendi beni bosi wuyizika mu ziami kisokolomu ditadi ; wunengumuna ditadi vana muelo ziami. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Maliya muisi Mangadala ayi Maliya ngudi yi Yose bamona buangu kioki bantula.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wufuluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayi 28.1-8</ref> ; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-11">Luka 24.1-11</ref> ; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-2">Yowani 20.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Lumbu ki saba bu kivioka, Maliya muisi Mangadala, Maliya ngudi yi Zaki ayi Salome, basumba malasi ma vinda mu nitu Yesu ; <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Bayenda ku biziami mu lumbu kitheti ki sabala buna buisi bukiedi ko bumboti. Bayenda buna thangu yeka ntotuka.<verse eid="MRK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Bayuvasana bawu na bawu mu nzila :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:3">—Nani wukuiza tunengumunina ditadi didi va muelo wu ziami e ?<verse eid="MRK 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Vayi bu bamvumbula meso, bamona ti ditadi diodi diba dinneni dinengumunu va ndambu.<verse eid="MRK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Bakota muna ziami beni, bamona ditoko dimosi divuata minledi miphembi buna kavuendi va ndambu koko ku lubakala. Baketo beka mona boma. <verse eid="MRK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Vayi ditoko beni diba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:6">—Bikanu mona boma ! Yesu muisi Nazaleti wubendu va dikulusi luntomba e ? Kasiedi vava ko ! Fulukidi ! Talanu buangu kioki bantula. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Vayi tumbu yendanu, lukamba minlonguki miandi ayi Piela, ti niandi wulutuaminini ku Ngalili. Kuna luela kummona, banga kuandi bobo kalukambila.<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Batotuka nsualu mu ziami ayi bazawula. Boma ayi lukhuku bibabuila. Kadi diambu dimosi basia kamba ko kadi mutu bila boma baba mona.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wumonikina minlonguki miandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>Yesu bu kafuluka mu nsuka wu lumbu kitheti ki sabala, wutuamamonikina theti Maliya muisi Mangadala, nketo wowo kakuta ziphevi tsambuadi zimbimbi. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Niandi wuyenda kamba nsamu beni kuidi bobo baba landakananga Yesu, bobo baba mu kaniki ayi baba dila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Vayi bawu bu bawa ti Yesu widi moyo ayi monikini Maliya, basia kunwilukila ko. <verse eid="MRK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Momo bu mavioka, wumonikina minlonguki miodi mu lunitu lunkaka bu baba diengila mu tsi. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Bavutuka ayi bakamba mambu beni kuidi batu bankaka vayi basia ku bawilukila ko.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Bosi, wubuela monikina diaka kumi mimvuala wumosi mu thangu baba va meza. Wuba tubidila mu diambu di kambu kuawu ku minu ayi mu diambu baba mintima miba banga matadi, bila basia wilukila ko batu bobobammona ti fulukidi mu bafua. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Buna wuba kamba :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:15">—Yendanu mu nza yimvimba, longanu Nsamu wumboti kuidi batu boso. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Woso mutu wela wilukila ayi wela botama, wela vuka. Vayi woso wela kambu wilukila, wela zengolo nkanu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Tala bidimbu biobi biela landakana batu bobo bela wilukila ; mu dizina diama : bela kuka ziphevi zimbimbi, bela yoluka zimbembo banzenza ; <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>bela simba zinioka ayi enati banuini yimbu kadi buma kiela ba vavanga ko. Bela tetikila bambevo mioko ayi ziela beluka.<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu wuyenda ku Diyilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Yesu bu kamana bakamba mambu momo, wutombolo ku Diyilu, wuyenda vuanda va koko ku lubakala lu Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Bosi minlonguki miyenda, balonga Nsamu wumboti va nza yimvimba. Pfumu wusala yawu va kimosi mu kisalu beni ayi wukindisa malongi mawu mu bikumu biobi biba landakananga malongi mawu.<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
